<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Arum Bibleh Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Ayohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ayohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">TSIFA NANA ANYI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ayohana</para>
  <para style="imt1">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Tsifa Reh A nga reh Fene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Nza anyi jiji reh tsifa tana a yama, tsifa reh tana a bu na Nnoh, tsifa reh tana a bu Nnoh. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Ata areh tana a bu na Nnoh anyi jiji ŋoh reh.<verse eid="JHN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Nnoh a lisa awumu mboh reh nambri ma aki bleh tsifa mboh reh, ma a sohroh a lisa andromboh anyi nimeh awumu mboh reh nambri kpeh, la ŋoh ta a yama feh. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />A bu tsifa reh nza a bu chuhu fene reh, tasa za a bu fene reh nza bu zana kyangwri mboh reh. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Zana reh ka a zana shini, shini neh ka a sohroh a nza a mlenze shira reh kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Nnoh tana a tohmoh kyangwri anyi ata isa a ŋoh nza bu Ayohana, <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />tana a ba la ŋoh ta a bleh kyangwri mboh ma ikpi zana reh, tana a kira la ma aki bleh tsifa reh kyangwri mboh nambri mata a nga agohsoh na ŋoh ata nza bu zana reh. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />A bu ŋoh Ayohana nza bu zana reh kpeh; Nnoh a tohmoh ŋoh la ta a ba ba a bleh kyangwri mboh ma ikpi zana reh. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Zana ata a zizi ŋoh ata nza a de zana a ba ma kyangwri mboh nambri reh a buti ba ma inziyo areh.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Tsifa reh tana a bu nimeh inziyo areh, tasa za Nnoh tana a lisa inziyo areh ma aki bleh tsifa reh, kyangwri mboh ma inziyo neh ma a sohroh a nza ŋoh a wina kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Tana a ba na kyangwri a ŋoh mboh, kyangwri a ŋoh mboh reh neh tama a sohroh a sa ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />mbohroh mgbiri amboh ata nza meh sa ŋoh reh, tasa amboh ata nza ma nga agohsoh amoh na isa a ŋoh, a nga mboh kira la mata a bu mara Nnoh mboh. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Ma a sohroh a bu mara Nnoh mboh ma aki la a bu kyangwri a mara mboh ma aki sangra imya kpeh, ma a sohroh a mara mboh tswanza amehreh kyangwri kpeh, ma a mara mboh reh neh na kira Nnoh.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Tsifa reh ka a bu kyangwri tasa za ka a lisa atsi tuma a ŋoh nimeh ambohroh. Mbohroh meh nza agba a ŋoh, agba ata nza anyi na Ada, a bu na lisa alindeh tasa za ka a bleh tsifa zizi.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Ayohana reh tana a bleh tsifa ma ikpi a ŋoh. Tana a vuru agba ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu ŋoh ata mya nza ni bleh la,&lt;Akyo ata nza a nati a ba ma nyina amya reh a keh meh, ŋoh reh a jiji a yama na amya&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />A bu tsifa lisa alindeh amehreh a ŋoh reh nza a leh a te reh atoh na tutu reh. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Nnoh tana a nga akpi a ŋoh reh ma Musa la ta a de a ba reh, lisa alindeh tasa bleh zizi reh a ba na ambohroh ma aki Yeso Kristi reh. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Akyo anyi kǝ hehreh nza Nnoh kpeh, amehreh Nnoh reh neh nza bu ŋoh tsene reh ata ŋoh nza a bu na Nnoh reh, a tuma na mgba alehmeh reh, Yeso reh a tsana ŋoh a kate na ambohroh.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsifa Ayohana Kyangwri Wra Batisma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Ama 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Ata areh a bu tsifa ata Ayohana ta ka a bleh ameh ata Yahudawa mboh nza ma a yama ma Urushalima tama ka a tohmoh Firist mboh tasa Lawiyawa mboh la, mata a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ bu anyi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Ayohana reh a sohroh a tana kpeh, ŋoh neh ka a bleh a kate la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bu Kristi kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Maka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Feh ni kǝ bu anyi? Ni bu Iliya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Ayohana ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Uwa&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">&lt;&lt;Ni bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Uwa&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Maka a bleh ŋoh la, ni kǝ bu anyi? Bleh reh timi na ni bleh amboh ata nza ma a tohmoh reh a ba na anzoh reh. Ni nati bleh reh la mboh ma ikpi anzoh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Ayohana ka a kira mboh ma kpi amgbasho tsifa Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bu agba ata nza ma a leh a fi ma inzi a tuhwara la, &lt;Lisa nnoh aki ma Nnoh reh yehlehleh ta a hehndeh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Farisiyawa amboh anyi amboh ata nza ma a tohmoh mboh reh <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu lele feh ni leh wra kyangwri mboh batisma nza noh ni bu kristi, ha Iliya, ha kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh kpeh reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Ayohana ka a kira mboh la,&lt;&lt;Meh wra nnoh batisma na amwo, akyo neh a yama nimeh amohnoh, ata mohnoh ni wina noh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />A bu ŋoh ata nza a nati a ba ma nyina amya reh, ata mya meh tswa meh ti hingre rishi akpehtreh hwana a ŋoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Ma a lisa awumu amboh areh nambri ma Betani, ata nza a bu na iba fini Urdu na mgba nnoh nerebi, atsi ata Ayohana nza ka a wra kyangwri mboh batisma reh.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bu Ameh Atashi Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Ibi na afri neh Ayohana ka a nza Yeso atsi ba na a ŋoh. Ayohana ka a bleh la.&lt;&lt;Nza ameh atashi Nnoh reh uweh, ata nza a gu kpakpana inziyo reh! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ata areh a bu andromboh ata mya nza ni bleh la, &lt;Kyangwri ata nza a nati a ba ma nyina amya reh a keh meh tsifa la ŋoh tana a jiji a yama neh ma a hehreh a mara meh kpeh.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Mya za meh tini wina ŋoh kpeh, tsifa ata neh mya meh ti kǝ ba bu leh wra mboh batisma na amwo reh tana a bu la mata a tsana ŋoh a kate ma kyangwri Israila mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Ayohana reh ka a bleh kyangwri mboh andromboh ata Nnoh nza a tsana ŋoh ma ikpi Yeso reh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh nza huru Nnoh atsi tamba anyi ma inza tswanza ikukuba ta ka a tamba a ba ba a tuma ma ikpi a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Meh tini hehreh wina Yeso na ichi ata areh za. A bu Nnoh neh ata nza a tohmoh meh la meh ti wra kyangwri mboh batisma na amwo reh a bleh meh la, &lt;Kyangwri ata ni nza huru atsi tamba ma ikpi a ŋoh reh, a bu ŋoh ata nza a nati a wra nnoh batisma na huru zanana reh.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Ayohana reh ka a bleh la, mya meh nza, meh nati wina bleh noh la ŋoh reh a bu amehreh Nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amboh Tufa Yeso amboh Ata Jiji Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Ibi na afri Ayohana ka a shi mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh afri ma a huru za. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Ayohana nza ka a nza Yeso atsi hende gǝga, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza nnoh, ameh atashi ata Nnoh reh uweh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Amboh tufa mboh afri nza maka a sehreh ŋoh atsi bleh dehreh reh, maka a tufa Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yeso nza ka a gyuruna, a ka a nza mboh atsi leh tufa ŋoh, a ka a luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni fa nnoh umbo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Rabbi&gt;&gt; areh a tsana la a bu kyangwri tsana) &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ tuma ma mma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ba nnoh na amya, ni nati nza noh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:39">amboh tufa mboh reh maka a na na a nza atsi tuma a ŋoh reh, maka a tuma na a ŋoh a gu ibi anyimbehreh, tana a bu noh anneh ata nvishi.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />anyimbehreh nimeh amoh a bu Andarawus, nza bu atsini Siman Abitrusu, ata nza a sehreh andromboh ata Ayohana nza a bleh reh, maka a tufa Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andromboh ata Andarawus ta ka a jiji a lisa reh, tana a jiji a fa atsini Siman Abitrusu ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh fa hunji akyo ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh&gt;&gt; (ŋoh a bu Kristi). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />A ka a gu Siman reh a na na Yeso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yeso a nza ŋoh ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu Siman amehreh Ayohana. Ma a nati a wina fi noh la Kefas.&gt;&gt; Ha Abitrusu lomo sa reh nza bu &lt;&lt;kpakpa&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A fi Filibus Mboh Ma Nataniyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Ibi nza ka a yanda, Yeso ka a kira la ŋoh ta a na Galili. Ka a hunji Filibus, a ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Tufa meh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filibus reh a bu kyangwri Betsaida, akpo afiya Andarawus mboh ma Abitrusu mboh. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filibus ka a hunji Nataniyel, ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;mbohroh meh hunji kyangwri ata Musa nza a ŋa tsifa ŋoh nimeh amgbasho akpi Nnoh reh, amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh za reh, tama a ŋa ma ikpi a ŋoh. Ŋoh reh a bu Yeso amehreh Yusufu ata nza anyi Nazaret.<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nataniyel reh ka luhu la, andromboh alindeh a nati a wina nyi Nazaret?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filibus ka a kira la, ba bu nza noh.<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yeso nza ka a nza Nataniyel atsi ba na a ŋoh reh, a ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza nnoh kyangwri Israila ata a zizi reh uweh, ata nza ka a huru tsifa kpeh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nataniyel reh ka a luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ni lisa lele feh ni wina meh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nza noh ameh ata ti kǝ bu ma chuhu agbeh mgbungba reh, a treh feh Filibus reh ka a fi noh.<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Nataniyel reh ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, ni bu amehreh Nnoh; ni bu Agohmoh Israila mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yeso ka a bleh ma Nataniyel reh la, &lt;&lt;Ni nga agohsoh na amya tsifa ata mya nza ni bleh noh la meh nza noh ma chuhu agbeh mgbungba reh. Ni nati nza awumu amboh ata ma a keh amboh ata areh. <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yeso ka a gyuru a bleh mboh za la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi, ni nati nza noh ma a vuru anida inza, tasa za mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh ma a nati a ka a nza tasa za mata a gyuru a tamba ma ikpi amya amehreh kyangwri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Ikira Wa Afya Ma Ka a na Ata Galili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ibi ata na atatoh nza ka a ba, ikira wa afya tana a yama ma akpo afiya Kaana ata Galili, akre Yeso za tana a yama ma a huru, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />tama a bleh Yeso mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh za la mata a ba ikira reh. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Amwo inabi nza ka a trina reh, akre Yeso ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Amwo inabi reh kǝ trina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Anna amya, ni kǝ ba na amya tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ameh amya kǝ hehreh ba kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Akre Yeso ka a bleh ma ahwra a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza a bleh noh la lisa nnoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Ma atsi a huru reh gama atehrehkifi a yama, biroh ika ata Yahudawa mboh maka a were amwo nimeh a hwara itoh amoh na wohroh reh, gama reh anyimbehreh ka a rya amwo amgbo agrumavoh ida afri a gu a na agrumavoh ida atatoh.<verse eid="JHN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yeso ka a bleh ma ahwra mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Fira amwo ba ba were su nnoh ma gama mboh reh nambri; maka a fira amwo ka a were a su ma gama mboh reh tehtehlehleh, <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />a ka gyuru a bleh mboh za la, &lt;&lt;Nehnehreh bara nnoh amwo reh na nnoh ma agba kyangwri kira reh.&gt;&gt; Maka a bara a na ŋoh, <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />agba kyangwri kira reh ka a wa amwo ata kǝ gyuru na bu amwo inabi reh a nza. A sohroh a wina atsi ata nza ma a de amwo inabi wohroh reh anyi kpeh, mboh ahwra mboh reh feh ma a wina atsi ata nza ma a fira amwo reh anyi. A ka a fi atsifa afiya afeh reh a na ni nda <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Maka a jiji a de amwo inabi alindeh ŋoh a ba ma kyangwri mata a wa feh, nza kyangwri ma a wa gaga, masa a de ata nza a zohhoh kpeh a ba, nnoh neh ni fira amwo inabi alindeh reh huho, ni tre fira ba nehnehreh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ata areh a bu kpra ŋara aniye ata jiji ŋoh, ata Yeso ta ka a lisa ma Kaana ata Galili reh. A tsana agba a ŋoh a kate, amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka a nga agohsoh amoh na a ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Ata areh nza ka a treh, Yeso ka a tamba a na ŋoh Kafarnahum, mboh ma akre tasa atsini mboh tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh, maka a tuma ma a huru a te ibi afri.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A na Ida Nnoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Ama 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mk 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Ameh kira gǝga handa Yahudawa mboh reh waka a ba nda, Yeso ka a na ŋoh Urushalima. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Nimeh ida Nnoh reh, ka hunji kyangwri amboh anyi atsi leh rifa na londo tasa atashi mboh tasa ikukuba mboh tasa amboh sehneh hungroh mboh ma a tuma ma ikpi ateburu. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Yeso ka a lisa anviri na rishi, ta ka a katsi mboh anyi nimeh ida Nnoh reh, kawa atashi mboh tasa londo mboh reh; a ka a druhu hungroh amboh sene hungroh mboh reh tasa za ka a krembe ateburu sene hungroh amoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh ata nza ma a rifa ikukuba mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Fira nnoh amboh ata areh kate nyi nnoh ma mareh, kama gu nnoh ida Nnoh ada amya ta bu noh kpakpranda rifa awumu kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a kohnoh ŋa ata nza ma a ŋa nimeh amgbasho reh la,&lt;&lt;Kira amya na afiya anzoh reh afya meh nimeh tswanza shira.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Agbugba Yahudawa mboh reh maka a luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;A bu kpra ŋara anneh atamaa ni nati lisa ti tsana reh la ni bu na wuwana lisa awumu amboh areh nambri?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Druhu nnoh ida Nnoh ata areh, meh nati gyuru mina nimeh ibi atatoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Yahudawa mboh reh maka a gyuru a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A gu ahushi agrumavoh ida anneh a hwa atehrehkifi atsi mina ida Nnoh reh, nnoh ni bleh la ni nati wina gyuru mina ida Nnoh reh nimeh ibi atatoh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ida Nnoh ata Yeso nza a leh atsifa ma ikpi reh neh a bu itoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Ma a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo a treh feh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh ma sa ka a kohnoh andromboh ata ta ka a bleh mboh reh. Maka a sa tsifa ŋa nimeh amgbasho reh a kira tasa tsifa ata Yeso ta ka a bleh mboh reh.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">1 Yeso A wina Agohsoh Kyangwri Mboh Nambri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ameh ata Yeso ta ka a treh a yama ma Urushalima na ameh ata kira gǝga handa reh, kyangwri mboh gaga maka a leh a nza ndohmoh ŋara aniye a ŋoh ata nza a leh a lisa reh, maka nga kira na isa a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Yeso neh a kira na amoh a treh kpeh, tsifa la ŋoh a wina mboh nambri. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />A kira la akyo anyi ta bleh tsifa andromboh ma ikpi kyangwri reh kpeh, ŋoh reh a wina andromboh ata nza a bu nimeh agohsoh kyangwri reh.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nikodimus A na Na Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Kyangwri Farisiyawa anyi tana a yama, isa a ŋoh tana a bu Nikodimus, tana a bu agba Yahudawa mboh. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />A ba ba a hunji Yeso nashi ni ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, Mbohroh meh wina la ni bu kyangwri tsana ata Nnoh nza a tohmoh nnoh a ba na ambohroh reh, akyo a nati a wina lisa kpra awumu ŋara aniye amboh ata areh kpeh, nza a bu akyo ata Nnoh nza a bu na a ŋoh feh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh ti bleh noh zizi, akyo anyi a nati a wina nza kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh kpeh, ma a nati a gyuru a mara ŋoh feh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodimus reh ka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ma a nati a lisa lele feh masa a gyuru a mara achoh kyangwri?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh a zizi tsifa, akyo a nati a wina niye nimeh akpo afiya Nnoh reh kpeh, nza ma a gyuru a mara ŋoh anyi nimeh amwo tasa huru feh. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Andromboh ata kyangwri nza a mara reh a bu kyangwri, ata huru nza a mara neh ka a bu huru a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Kama ŋara anneh na tsifa ata mya nza ni bleh noh la, &lt;Ma a nati a gyuru a mara nnoh kanga feh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Inyo reh ka afo a na mgba ata ŋoh nza a kira. Ni kǝ sehreh gohroh inyo reh, nnoh neh ni wina atsi ata nza anyi ha atsi ata nza a na reh kpeh. Ka bu dehreh na akyo ata huru nza a mara ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodimus reh ka luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a nati ka bu dehreh lele?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yeso reh ka a gyuru a bleh ŋoh za la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu agba kyangwri tsana ata israila mboh, nnoh neh ni sohroh wina awumu amboh areh kpeh? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Meh bleh noh a zizi, mbohroh meh leh bleh tsifa ma ikpi andromboh ata mbohroh meh wina, tasa za meh bleh noh andromboh ata mbohroh timi nza na kpikpi reh, mohnoh neh ni leke ti sa kira nnoh andromboh ata mbohroh meh bleh noh reh. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Meh leh tsifa na amohnoh ma ikpi awumu ata ma yama ma inziyo areh, mohnoh neh ni sohroh sa tsifa reh kira nnoh kpeh; a bu lele feh ni nati kǝ sa kira nnoh nza meh bleh noh tsifa ma ikpi awumu amboh ata ma a bu ma inza reh? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Akyo anyi kǝ hehreh ka na inza reh nza kpeh, a zaka a bu mya amehreh kyangwri reh mya tsimya ma ata mya nza ni nyi inza ba reh. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />A tswanza Musa ta ka a gu andromboh anyi a ka tswanza iyoh ata karafi reh a ka ma inza ma hohroh bini, dehreh za ma a nati a gu amehreh kyangwri a ka ma inza kanga, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />la akyo ata nza nga agohsoh na a ŋoh reh ta a hunji fene ata tuma atono.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Nnoh reh a kira na kyangwri mboh ma inziyo areh gaga, a gu amehreh a ŋoh anyimbehreh reh a fanga tsifa amoh, tsifa la akyo ata nza a nga agohsoh na a ŋoh reh ta a kama a kwo kpeh, ŋoh neh ta a hunji fene ata tuma atono. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Nnoh reh a sohroh a tohmoh amehreh a ŋoh a ba inziyo areh la ta a hwra akpi ma kyangwri mboh ma inziyo areh kpeh, a tohmoh a ba neh tsifa la inziyo reh ta a hunji nvara ma aki a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Akyo ata nza a nga agohsoh na amehreh Nnoh reh, ma a nati a hwra ŋoh akpi kpeh. Akyo ata neh nza a nga agohsoh na Amehreh Nnoh kpeh reh, akpi a ŋoh a bu hwra ŋoh tsifa la a sohroh a nga agohsoh na isa Amehreh Nnoh nza bu ŋoh tsene ma reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Ma a nati a shimba hwra akpi reh la: Zana a ba ma inziyo areh, kyangwri neh ma kira shini a keh zana tsifa la ndohmoh amoh a bu ata agugu. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Akyo ata nza a te ndohmoh agugu reh a nati a kira zana kpeh, tasa za a nati a wina ba atsi ata zana nza a yama reh kpeh, tsifa la mata a vushi ndohmoh agugu a ŋoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Akyo ata nza a lisa awumu yehlehleh reh, a nati a wina ba atsi ata zana nza a yama reh, la mata a nza ŋoh kakende la andromboh ata ŋoh nza a lisa reh a lisa ma aki Nnoh.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayohana Kyangwri Wra Batisma A bleh Tsifa Ma Ikpi Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Areh nza ka a trina reh, Yeso tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a na amoh akpo afiya Yahudiya. A na na a yanda na amoh shidi ma a huru, atsi leh wra kyangwri mboh batisma. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Ayohana za tana a leh a wra kyangwri mboh batisma ma Ainon ata nza a bu ma inda Salima, tsifa la amwo tana a yama gaga ma kpra Agohmoh reh. Kyangwri maka a leh a gya lo a ba la mata a wra mboh batisma. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Ata areh a bu neh ma a hehreh a de Ayohana a fi ma ida ka kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Amboh tufa Ayohana mboh reh maka a leh a yaha aniye mboh ma kyangwri Yahudawa anyi ma ikpi hwara itoh amoh Yahudawa mboh reh. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Maka a ba na Ayohana, maka a ba ba a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, kyangwri ata nza a bu na anzoh na ba fini Urdu na mgba nnoh nvishi reh, ata nnoh na ikpi anzoh nza ni tsifa ma ikpi a ŋoh reh, nza ŋoh ari atsi leh wra batisma ma kyangwri mboh, tasa kyangwri mboh maka a leh a na na a ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Ayohana reh ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri a nati a wina sa andromboh ata nza ma nga ŋoh anyi inza ma reh. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Mohnoh na ikpi amohnoh ni nati bleh noh tsifa ma ikpi amya la, &lt;Mya meh bu Kristi kpeh, Nnoh neh a tohmoh meh la meh ti ba bu lisa awumu mboh reh bana Kristi.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Nza kyangwri a sa afya afeh, afya afeh reh a bu atsifa ŋoh. Iza atsifa afya afeh ata nza a yama ma atsi wa afya reh, a nati a shi ta a sehreh andromboh ata atsifa afya afeh nza a nati a bleh ŋoh reh. A nati a bu na johjoh nza ŋoh ka a sehreh andromboh ata atsifa afya afeh nza a nati a bleh ŋoh reh. A nati a bu ma aki wohroh za johjoh agohsoh amya a nati ka a su. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Yeso reh a nati a leh a rya tohmoh a nina; mya neh meh nati gyuru leh nyinana.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŋoh Ata Nza Anyi Inza A ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />&lt;&lt;Yeso ata nza anyi inza a ba reh, a keh awumu mboh reh nambri; akyo ata nza anyi inziyo a ba reh ŋoh a bu ata inziyo, tasa za ŋoh ka atsifa tswanza akyo ata nza anyi inziyo reh. Ŋoh ata neh nza anyi inza reh a keh awumu mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />A bleh kyangwri mboh ma ikpi andromboh ata ŋoh nza a nza tasa ata ŋoh nza a sehreh za reh. Kyangwri neh ma a sohroh a sa tsifa a ŋoh reh a kira kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Kyangwri ata nza a nga agohsoh na tsifa a ŋoh ata nza bu hama reh, a kira za la Nnoh reh a bu zizi. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Akyo ata Nnoh nza a tohmoh reh, a leh a bleh tsifa Nnoh, tsifa la a bu Nnoh mi a nga ŋoh huru a ŋoh ata nza bu gaga reh. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Ada a kira na amehreh a ŋoh, a ka ata awumu reh nambri ma ivoh amehreh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Akyo ata nza a nga agohsoh na amehreh a ŋoh reh, a bu na fene ata tuma atono, akyo ata neh nza a leke amehreh a ŋoh reh, a nati a hunji fene kpeh, gofo Nnoh reh a nati a treh a bu ma ikpi a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso Mboh Ma Afya Samariya Anyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Farisiyawa mboh maka a sehreh la Yeso a leh a hunji amboh tufa mboh tasa za a leh a wra batisma ma kyangwri mboh a keh Ayohana, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />tana bu Yeso neh na ikpi a ŋoh atsi leh wra mboh batisma reh kpeh, tana bu amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh mi. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Yeso ka a sehreh andromboh ata Yahudawa mboh nza ma a leh atsifa ma ikpi reh, a ka yi Yahudiya ata neh ta ka a na a ŋoh Galili.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Nza a nati a bu ma aki na ŋoh Galili reh, a nati a gǝga akpo afiya Samariya. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />A ka a na akpo afiya anyi ma Samariya ata nza maka a fi la Saikar. Akpo afiya reh a bu ma inda akpo inzi ata Yakubu ta ka a nga amehreh ŋoh Yusufu na kiri reh. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />A bu ma a huru itsiyo amwo Yakubu nza a yama reh. Yeso kǝ kwo ho na hende, a ka a tuma ma akechi tsiyo amwo reh, areh tana a bu na atsitsi fi noh.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Afya Samariya anyi ka a ba atsi bara amwo. Yeso ka a bleh ma afya reh la, &lt;&lt;Nga meh amwo meh ti wa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh feh tama a na amoh atsi sa rya nimeh akpo afiya reh. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Afya Samariya reh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh ni bu kyangwri Yahudawa mi, mya neh meh bu afya Samariya. A bu lele feh ni luhu meh la meh ti nga nnoh amwo wa? Yahudawa mboh tasa Samariya mboh reh ta maka a nza itoh amoh kpeh ma iyo.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yeso reh ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ma a bleh la ni wina ngǝnga Nnoh reh, tasa akyo ata nza a luhu nnoh la, nga meh amwo meh ti wa reh, nnoh ni gyuru kwere ŋoh ta a nga noh amwo ata hunji fene reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Afya reh ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri agba, noh ni bu na aguga kpi amwo na wohroh kpeh tasa za itsiyo reh aniye. Ni nati hunji amwo ata fene reh nyi mma? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Nnoh reh ni keh Ada ambohroh Yakubu, ata nza nga reh itsiyo amwo reh, ŋoh na ikpi a ŋoh, tasa mara a ŋoh mboh, tasa bibi a ŋoh mboh tasa atashi a ŋoh mboh tasa londo a ŋoh mboh za nza maka a wa amwo reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a wa amwo ata areh, yohroh amwo a nati a gyuru a keh ŋoh, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />akyo ata neh nza a nati a wa amwo ata mya nza ni nati nga ŋoh reh, yohroh amwo a nati a de ŋoh za kpeh. Amwo ata mya nza nati nga ŋoh reh, a nati a bu tswanza tsiyo amwo nimeh a ŋoh, tsiyo amwo ata nza a nati a de amwo alindeh ata hunji fene ata tuma atono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Afya reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri agba, nga meh amwo wa ata wohroh reh, yohroh amwo ta a za a keh meh za kpeh, meh ti za gyuru ba atsi leh bara amwo ma mareh za kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Na ni fi atsifa anzoh ti ba nnoh mohnoh ma a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Afya reh ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bu na atsifa kpeh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yeso ka a kira ma afya reh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bleh yehlehleh nnoh nza ni bleh la ni bu na atsifa kpeh reh. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />A zizi tsifa reh a bu la, tini sa tsifa mboh ata ma a tswa atsi bu atungu nehnehreh, akyo ata nza ni bu noh mohnoh ma a ŋoh nehnehreh reh a sohroh bu atsifa anzoh kpeh. Ni bleh meh a zizi tsifa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Afya reh ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri agba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Meh wina la ni bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Ada ambohroh mboh tama a krumusu Nnoh ma agbohgboh ata areh, mohnoh Yahudawa mboh neh ni bleh noh la a zohhoh meh ti krumusu Nnoh ma Urushalima ma kanga.<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yeso ka a bleh ma afya reh la, &lt;&lt;Afya agba, nga agohsoh na andromboh ata mya nza nati bleh noh reh, ameh a nati a ba ata kyangwri ma a za a nati a wina krumusu Ada ma ikpi agbohgboh ata areh ha Urushalima za kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />mohnoh kyangwri Samariya mboh ni kǝ krumusu nnoh andromboh ata ni wina noh kpeh reh. mbohroh Yahudawa mboh neh meh wina andromboh ata nza meh krumusu reh, nvara reh feh tana anyi na Yahudawa mboh. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ameh neh a buti a ba, nehnehreh kǝ ba uweh ata amboh krumusu Nnoh ata a zizi reh ma a nati a krumusu Ada nimeh huru tasa nimeh zizi, Ada reh a fa amboh ika wohroh reh la mata a krumusu ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Nnoh reh a bu huru, amboh nza ma a nati a krumusu ŋoh reh za mata a krumusu ŋoh nimeh huru, tasa nimeh a zizi za.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Afya reh ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh wina Almasihu ata maka a fi ŋoh la Kristi a nati a ba, nza a ba reh a nati a tsana reh awumu mboh reh nambri.<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yeso ka a bleh ma afya reh la, &lt;&lt;Mya nza ni leh tsifa na anzoh reh, a bu mya ŋa ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">amboh Tufa Mboh Reh Ma A gyuru A ba Amoh Na Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Na ameh wohroh reh, amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka a gyuru a ba ba a hunji ŋoh, tasa za maka a ŋara aniye na a ŋoh atsi leh tsifa na afya reh. Akyo amoh anyi neh a sohroh a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ kira umbo?&gt;&gt; ha &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ tsifa na afya reh tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Afya reh ka ata amgbogbo a ŋoh mboh ma a huru, ta ka a gbo a na na a bleh kyangwri mboh ma akpo afiya reh la, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />&lt;&lt;Ba bu nza noh kyangwri anyi ata nza a leh a bleh meh awumu ata meh ti kǝ lisa mboh na kpikpi reh. Ha a nati bu ŋoh reh ŋa Kristi reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Kyangwri mboh reh feh maka a kate anyi afiyafiya amoh mboh ka leh a ba na a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Ma a huru reh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a leh a vohvoh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana ambohroh, fa andromboh ti rya zu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Yeso neh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bu na irya anyi ata meh nati rya ata mohnoh ni wina noh andromboh ma ikpi kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Dehreh za amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a luhu itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Ha akyo anyi ta a de rya a ba ŋoh? <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Irya amya a bu meh ti lisa andromboh ata ŋoh nza a tohmoh meh reh a kira, tasa za meh ti tre ndohmoh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />mohnoh ni bleh noh la, &lt;A treh a hwa nara aniye mata a fasa awumu aye a ba afya kpeh? <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Kyangwri fasa awumu aye ba afiya ka a hunji firoh a ŋoh, ka a dohdohsoh kyangwri mboh reh a gya tswanza awumu aye ata hunji fene ata tuma atono, la kyangwri biya awumu tasa kyangwri fasa awumu aye ba afya reh mata johjoh. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Ma a huru tsifa reh a nati ka bu zizi la, &lt;Akyo anyi a biya awumu aye, akyo anyi a fasa awumu anyi aye.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Meh tohmoh nnoh la ti na ni fasa nnoh andromboh ata ni te noh ndohmoh ma ikpi kpeh reh. Mgbiri ma a te ndohmoh, mohnoh neh ni fasa nyi nnoh na ndohmoh ata mgbiri ma a te reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri Samariya Mboh Ma A nga Agohsoh Amoh Ma Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Kyangwri Samariya mboh gaga nza ma anyi ma akpo afiya reh, maka a nga agohsoh amoh ma Yeso ma ikpi tsifa ata afya reh nza a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bleh meh awumu ata meh ti kǝ lisa na kpikpi reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Kyangwri Samariya mboh nza maka a ba na a ŋoh reh, maka a kwere ŋoh la ta tuma na amoh, a ka a tuma a te mboh ibi afri. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Kyangwri gaga maka nga agohsoh amoh ma Yeso ma ikpi tsifa a ŋoh mboh reh, <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />maka a bleh ma afya reh la, &lt;&lt;Nehnehreh mbohroh meh nga agohsoh ambohroh ma Yeso, a za a bu ma ikpi andromboh ata Mbohroh nza meh sehreh nyi na anzoh reh kpeh, a bu tsifa la mbohroh meh sere nyi na a ŋoh na ikpi ambohroh, tasa za meh wina la a bu ŋoh zizi ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana ma inziyo areh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Wuwana Ma Amehreh Agba Kyangwri Hwra Akpi Anyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ibi afri nza ka a gǝga reh, a ka a na ŋoh Galili. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yeso za na ikpi a ŋoh tana a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ma a nati a nga agba ma kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh ma akpo afiya a ŋoh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Nza ka a ba ba aniye ma Galili reh, kyangwri Galili mboh reh maka a ringa ŋoh. Mboh reh tama a nza andromboh ata ŋoh ta ka a leh a lisa ma Urushalima na ameh ata tama ka a na atsi kira te hwana reh.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yeso ka a gyuru a ba a ŋoh akpo afiya Kaana ata Galili, atsi ata ŋoh ta ka a gyuru amwo wusu ta bu amwo inabi reh. Ma a huru reh, agba kyangwri hwra akpi anyi a yama, ata amehreh a ŋoh a wuwana kpeh ma Kafarnahum. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Kyangwri reh nza ka sehreh la Yeso kǝ gyuru nyi Galili ba ŋoh Yahudiya, a ka a na na a kwere ŋoh la ta a ba ba a nga wuwana ma amehreh a ŋoh ata kǝ ba whiri ta a kwo.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza mohnoh ni nza noh kpra mboh tasa ndohmoh ŋara aniye kpeh reh, ni nati nga nnoh kira amohnoh na tsifa amya kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Kyangwri te ndohmoh ma ida hwra akpi reh ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri agba, tamba fya amehreh amya reh sa a kwo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Na anzoh, amehreh anzoh a nati a gyuru a hunji fene&gt;&gt; Kyangwri reh ka sa kira na andromboh ata Yeso nza a bleh ŋoh reh, a ka a na ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Kyangwri reh a ka a bu ma aki na ŋoh afiya, ahwra a ŋoh mboh maka a gbo a ba ba a hunji ŋoh, maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Amehreh anzoh kǝ hunji fene. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />A ka a luhu mboh ameh ata amehreh na a hunji wuwana reh, maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Bishi reh ata ŋoh na mole na mgba nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Alehmeh amehreh reh ka a wina la, a bu ameh wohroh yehlehleh Yeso ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Na anzoh, amehreh anzoh a nati a gyuru a hunji fene.&gt;&gt;Kyangwri mboh tasa amboh afiya a ŋoh mboh a nga agohsoh amoh na Yeso.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ata areh a bu ndohmoh ŋara aniye ata afri ata Yeso ta ka a lisa ameh ata ŋoh ta ka ata Yahudiya a na ŋoh Galili reh.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Wuwana Ma Kyangwri Agugrutu Hwana Anyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Ibi anyi, Yeso ka a na ŋoh Urushalima, atsi kira Yahudawa mboh. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ma Urushalima reh, anida anyi a yama maka a fi la anida atashi mboh, amwo anyi a yama ma a huru kaǝkaereh ata nza ma a kpafa a goh na dasa atungu, ata maka a fi amwo kaǝkaereh reh na mgba Yahudawa mboh la Betasda. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />amboh ata nza ma a wuwana kpeh reh ma a leh nimeh dasa reh, amboh hama iyo, tasa amboh agugrutu hwana mboh, tasa amboh ata nza ma a kwo a tamba mgba anyimbehreh. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Maka a shi a bana la mata a tsu amwo reh. Ameh ata Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh Ada ka a tamba anyi inza, la akyo ata ta a jiji aniye a na nimeh amwo neh ma a tsu amwo reh, ŋoh ka a hunji wuwana anyi na biroh bishi mboh ma itoh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Ma a huru reh kyangwri anyi a bu na bishi ahushi agrumavoh ida atatoh a hwa atsiyatsiya. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yeso nza ka a nza ŋoh atsi leh ma inzi reh, ŋoh ka a wina la kyangwri reh kǝ yanda na bishi reh ma itoh a ŋoh, a ka a bleh ma kyangwri reh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kira ti hunji wuwana?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Kyangwri bishi reh ka a kira ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri agba, Mya meh bu na akyo ata nza a nati a shingi meh meh ti niye nimeh amwo kaǝkaereh reh ameh ata ma a tsu amwo reh kpeh. Meh kǝ kira ti niye neh akyo anyi kǝ jiji meh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;De hinga! ti gu atakpa anzoh ti hende.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Ma hwana anyimbehreh kyangwri reh ka a hunji wuwana; ka a gu atakpa a ŋoh ta ka a hehndeh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Andromboh ata areh a bu ma ibi Asabar, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />nza ka a bu dehreh, Yahudawa mboh maka a bleh ma kyangwri ata nza a hunji wuwana reh la, &lt;&lt;Andrehmeh a bu ibi Asabar; ma ikpi tsana amgbasho Musa reh, a zohhoh ti gu atakpa anzoh na anzoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Kyangwri reh neh ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata nza a nga meh wuwana reh a bleh meh la meh ti gu atakpa amya meh ti hende.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A ka bu kyangwri atamaa nza a bleh noh la ti gu atakpa anzoh hende reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Kyangwri ata nza a hunji wuwana reh a ka a wina ha a ka bu anyi nga ŋoh wuwana reh kpeh, vara kyangwri tama a yama ma a huru, Yeso feh kǝ hwa bleh ma hohroh kyangwri mboh reh.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />A yanda kpeh Yeso ka a gyuru a hunji ŋoh nimeh ida Nnoh reh, a ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza, nnoh ni hunji wuwana. Kama za lisa agugu za kpeh, la andromboh anyi ata nza a keh ata areh ta za a hunji noh za kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Kyangwri reh ka a na na a bleh ma Yahudawa mboh reh la a bu Yeso nza a nga ŋoh wuwana reh.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fene Ma Aki Amehreh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Tsifa la Yeso a leh a lisa awumu mboh reh ma ibi Asabar, Yahudawa mboh reh maka a leh nga Yeso iya. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ada amya a bu nimeh te ndohmoh a gu a ba ba te nehnehreh, mya za meh leh te ndohmoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />A bu ma ikpi tsifa ata areh Yahudawa mboh nza maka a leh a fa akeki na wuwana la mata a mla ŋoh a kwo reh; a sohroh bu tsifa la a kputu Asabar reh kpeh, ŋoh za neh a leh a fi Nnoh la Alehmeh, areh ka a gu ikpi ŋoh la ŋoh bu anyimbehreh na Nnoh.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wuwana Yeso Amehreh Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi, Amehreh a nati a wina lisa andromboh ŋoh tsene kpeh, a nati a bu andromboh ata ŋoh nza a nza anyi na alehmeh reh feh. A bu andromboh ata Alehmeh nza a lisa reh, wohroh Amehreh a ŋoh za a nati a lisa. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Alehmeh a kira na Amehreh a ŋoh reh, tasa za a tsana ŋoh awumu ata ŋoh nza ka a lisa mboh reh nambri, a nati a tsana ŋoh mgbiri awumu amboh ata nza a keh amboh ata areh za, la mohnoh ti ŋara nnoh aniye. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Tswanza Ada nza ka a yiri kyangwri mboh anyi ma kwo ta nga mboh fene reh, dehreh za Amehreh a ŋoh a nati nga fene ma akyo ata ŋoh nza a kira reh. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Ada za ka a sohroh a hwra akpi ma akyo kpeh, ŋoh neh nga wuwana ma amehreh ŋoh, la Amehreh a ŋoh reh ta ahwra akpi ma kyangwri mboh reh nambri, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />la kyangwri mboh mata nga amehreh a ŋoh reh agba, tswanza nza ma nga alehmeh agba za reh. Akyo ata nza nga agba ma amehreh a ŋoh reh kpeh, a sohroh nga agba ma Ada ata ŋoh nza a tohmoh meh reh kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Meh bleh noh zizi, akyo ata nza a sehreh tsifa amya, tasa za ta a nga agohsoh na akyo ata nza a tohmoh meh reh, a bu na fene ata tuma atono, ma a nati a sohroh ahwra ŋoh akpi kpeh; ŋoh reh kǝ hwana ta kwo gyuru ba ŋoh na fene. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Meh bleh noh zizi, ameh a nati a ba, ameh reh kǝ ba, ata kunu mboh ma a nati a sehreh agba Amehreh Nnoh, amboh ata nza ma a nati a sehreh reh ma a nati hunji fene. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Tswanza Ada na ikpi ma nza nga kyangwri mboh fene reh, ma aki wohroh za nga wuwana ma Amehreh a ŋoh reh ta nga fene ma kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Alehmeh reh kǝ nga wuwana ma Amehreh a ŋoh reh la ta ahwra akpi ma kyangwri mboh. Tsifa la ŋoh reh a bu Amehreh kyangwri.<verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Kama ŋara nnoh aniye na tsifa ata areh kpeh, ameh a nati a ba ata kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a bu nimeh ikpi nyifo reh, ma a nati a sehreh agba a ŋoh reh, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />ma a nati a kate, mboh kyangwri amboh ata nza ma lisa alindeh reh ma a nati a hinga mata a hunji fene, kyangwri amboh ata nza ma lisa awumu abibi reh ma a nati a hinga mata hwra mboh akpi. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Meh nati wina lisa andromboh ata ikpi mya kpeh; meh hwra akpi amya tswanza mya nza ni sere nyi na Ada reh, hwra akpi amya reh a bu zizi, a bu andromboh ata agohsoh amya nza a kira mya nza ni lisa reh kpeh, mya neh meh lisa andromboh ata ŋoh ata nza a tohmoh meh reh kira.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A bleh Tsifa Mboh Reh Ma Ikpi Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />&lt;&lt;Nza mya meh bleh tsifa ma ikpi amya, akyo anyi a nati a kira la bleh tsifa amya reh a bu zizi kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Akyo anyi a yama ata ŋoh nza a leh a bleh tsifa mboh reh ma ikpi amya, tasa za meh wina la tsifa mboh ata ŋoh nza a leh a bleh mboh ma ikpi amya reh ma bu zizi. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Tini tohmoh nnoh kyangwri mboh na nnoh la mata a na na a luhu Ayohana tsifa ma ikpi amya. Andromboh ata ŋoh nza a bleh noh ma ikpi amya reh a bu zizi. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Mya reh meh kira la akyo anyi ta atsifa ma ikpi amya kpeh. Mya neh meh bleh noh tsifa amboh ata areh la ti hunji noh nvara. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Tsifa Ayohana ma ikpi amya reh tana a tswanza shira afitila ata ta ka a leh a de a tsana atsifi reh, mohnoh ni kira ni kǝ johjoh nnoh na zana a ŋoh reh shidi ma, a sohroh a yanda kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />&lt;&lt;Mya neh meh bu na tsifa anyi ata meh nati bleh ma ikpi amya ata nza a keh Ayohana a ŋoh reh. Ndohmoh ata mya nza ni leh lisa reh, ata Ada amya nza a nga la meh ti lisa reh, a bu awumu amboh wohroh nza a nati a tsana akyo ata mya nza ni bu reh. Ma a tsana fyafya la a bu Ada mi a tohmoh meh. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Ada ata ŋoh nza a tohmoh meh reh, a bu ŋoh na ikpi a ŋoh ata nza a bleh kyangwri mboh ma ikpi amya reh. mohnoh ni hehreh sere nnoh agba a ŋoh ha la ti nza noh na iyo kpeh, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />tasa za tsifa a ŋoh ka a sohroh tuma ma agohsoh amohnoh kpeh, ni sohroh nga nnoh kira na akyo ata Ada nza a tohmoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Ni kǝ tufa nnoh ŋa nimeh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh ve, ni kohnoh nnoh la ni nati hunji noh fene ata tuma atono nimeh amoh. A bu tsifa Nnoh amboh areh nza ma a bleh tsifa ata a zizi ma ikpi amya reh, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />mohnoh neh ni leke ti ba bu hunji noh fene na amya.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />&lt;&lt;Mya meh kǝ sa riri nyi na kyangwri mboh kpeh, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />mya neh meh wina noh. Meh wina la ni bu noh na kira Nnoh ma agohsoh amohnoh mboh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Mya meh ba nimeh sa Ada amya, ni sohroh sa meh noh kpeh; nza akyo anyi tse neh a ba nimeh isa a ŋoh, ni nati sa nnoh. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Ni nati lisa nnoh lele feh si nga nnoh kira amohnoh na amya, mohnoh ata nza ni leh sa nnoh riri nyi nnoh na itoh amohnoh, mohnoh neh ni sohroh fa nnoh akeki ti hunji noh riri ata nza anyi na Nnoh reh kpeh?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Mohnoh neh ti kama nza noh la meh nati bleh ma Ada amya la ni lisa noh andromboh abibi kpeh. Akyo ata nza a nati a bleh reh a bu Musa, ata mohnoh nza ni gya noh agohsoh amohnoh na a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Nza ni nga nnoh kira na Musa, ni nati nga nnoh kira na amya za, a bu ŋoh tana a ŋa ma ikpi amya. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Nza mohnoh neh ni nga agohsoh amohnoh na andromboh ata ŋoh nza a ŋa ma amgbasho reh kpeh, ni nati lisa noh lele feh si kǝ nga noh kira na tsifa amya reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Rya Ma Kyangwri Dubu Atungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Ama 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />A mehheh neh, Yeso ka a te a hwana fini Galili, ata maka a fi la fini Tibariya <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Vara kyangwri maka a leh a tufa ŋoh, tsifa ata nza ma a nza ŋoh atsi leh lisa awumu ŋara aniye nga kyangwri mboh wuwana reh. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yeso ka a gyuru a ka a na ŋoh agbohgboh a na na a tuma mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Na ameh wohroh reh, kira gǝga handa Yahudawa mboh reh kǝ ba nda.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yeso nza ka a gu ikpi a ka a nza duma mboh atsi la ba na a ŋoh reh, a ka a bleh ma Filibus la, &lt;&lt;Meh kǝ nati hunji afohfohnoh ma mgbata ata kyangwri ma a nati a rya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yeso luhu Filibus tsifa reh, la ŋoh ta a tsara ŋoh a nza, ŋoh Yeso kǝ wina andromboh ata ŋoh nza a nati a lisa reh.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filibus ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Hungroh nara atsiyatsiya ata maka a fanga kyangwri sa nara, a nati a tswa mata a sa afohfohnoh ata mata a hunji shishidi kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa Yeso mboh, ata isa a ŋoh nza a bu Andarawus, atsini Siman Abitrusu, ka a bleh ma Yeso la, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />&lt;&lt;Nza amehreh anyi uweh, a bu na mara afohfohnoh atungu tasa mara kpukpo atsibinaa afri, amboh areh neh ma a nati a lisa lele feh sa a tswa vara kyangwri mboh reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Bleh nnoh kyangwri mboh reh ma a tuma ma inzi.&gt;&gt; Ma a huru reh mara bini mboh ma a yama gaga, tsifa mboh maka a tuma ma inzi, ma a nati a tswa atsi bu dubu atungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yeso ka a fira afohfohnoh mboh reh ma ivoh a ŋoh, ta ka a kwende Nnoh ma ikpi ŋoh, a ka a gafa ma amboh ata nza ma a tuma ma inzi reh, a lisa dehreh na kpukpo atsibinaa mboh reh za, rya reh a tswa mboh nambri ma amoh.<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Nza maka a rya ka a hunu reh, ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Fira nnoh mgbiri mboh nza ma a rya a hwa reh ba nnoh, la ta kama a te abibi kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Maka a fira mgbiri afohfohnoh ata nza ma a rya a hwa reh, a su akwri agrumavoh a hwa afri a mishi a wa ata kyangwri ma a hehreh a rya kpeh reh.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Kyangwri nza maka a nza kpra ata ŋara aniye ata Yeso nza a lisa reh, maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Zizi ata areh a bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh ata nza a nati a ba inziyo reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yeso reh a wina la kyangwri mboh reh ma a kira mata a de ŋoh a te Agohmoh na wuwana, ka a gyuru a ka a na a ŋoh agbohgboh reh ŋoh tsene.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A ka A hehndeh Ma Ikpi Amwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Ama 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mk 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Nvishi nza ka a ba reh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a gyuru a tamba a na amoh fini reh, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh maka a jiji a hwana fini reh a na amoh Kafarnahum. Shini nza ka a hungwa neh Yeso kǝ hehreh ba kpeh <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Inyo anyi ka a ba na wuwana amwo fini reh ka a te a kwere. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Mboh nza maka a hehndeh a na mili atatoh ha anneh, maka a nza Yeso atsi hende ma ikpi amwo, a ka a ba ma inda gbogblondo amwo reh, maka a nyiri. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Yeso neh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu mya, kama nyiri nnoh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Mboh reh maka a kira maka ata ŋoh la ta aniye a na na amoh nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh, ma a huru heri gbogblondo amwo reh ka a de mboh a na ma akachi fini atsi tamba amoh reh.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri mboh ma a fa Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ibi nza ka a yanda, mgbiri kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a tuma na iba fini reh, ma a nza la gbogblondo amwo reh a bu anyimbehreh ma ma a huru, Yeso a sohroh niye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh kpeh, a bu amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh ma mboh tsimoh. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Mgbiri gbogblondo amwo amboh anyi ma anyi Tibariya ma a ba ba a shi ma atsi ata duma mboh tama ka a rya afohfohnoh neh Ada kǝ kwere Nnoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Duma mboh nza maka a nza la Yeso tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh ma a yama ma a huru za kpeh reh, maka aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh ka a na amoh Kafarnahum atsi hende fa Yeso.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Bu Afohfohnoh Ata Fene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Nza maka a hunji ŋoh na ba fini reh, maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, nnoh ni ba ma mareh na ameh atamaa?<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi, ni fa meh noh tsifa la neh kira ti rya nnoh afohfohnoh reh hunu nnoh, mohnoh neh ni fa meh noh tsifa kpra awumu ŋara aniye amya reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Kama te noh ndohmoh iya ma ikpi irya ata nza a nati a te abibi kpeh, mohnoh neh te noh ndohmoh ma ikpi irya ata nza a nati a yanda ti hunji noh fene ata tuma atono. Ata areh ŋa a bu irya ata Amehreh kyangwri nza a nati a nga noh reh. A bu ma ikpi Amehreh kyangwri ŋa Ada Nnoh kǝ gya hama a ŋoh ta a tsana kira a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Kyangwri mboh reh maka a luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;A bu umbo meh nati te meh ti lisa ndohmoh ata Nnoh nza a kira reh?<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu andromboh ata Ada nza a kira la ti lisa nnoh, nga nnoh kira na akyo ata Nnoh nza a tohmoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Kyangwri mboh reh maka a luhu Yeso la,&lt;&lt;A bu kpra ŋara aniye amboh atamaa ni nati lisa Mbohroh meh ti nza nga agohsoh na anzoh? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Ada ambohroh mboh tama a rya manna ma hohroh bini; tswanza nza ma a ŋa a gya nimeh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh la,&lt;A nga mboh rya anyi ma inza la mata a rya.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi, tana a bu Musa ŋa ta ka a nga noh afohfohnoh anyi ma inza reh kpeh, a bu Ada amya mi ata nza a leh a nga noh rya ata a zizi anyi ma inza reh. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Irya ata Nnoh reh a bu ŋoh ata nza anyi inza a ba reh ta a nga inziyo fene.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri agba, Mbohroh meh kwere nnoh la ti leh nga reh biroh rya ika wohroh na tutu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bu rya ata a nati a nga noh fene. Akyo ata nza a ba na amya reh a nati a na ŋoh na nyo kpeh, tasa za akyo ata nza a nga agohsoh a ŋoh na amya reh, yohroh amwo a nati a de ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Tswanza meh ti kǝ bleh noh reh, mohnoh tini nza meh noh, mohnoh neh ni sohroh nga nnoh kira na amya kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Kyangwri amboh ata Ada nza ata mboh ma ivoh amya reh ma a nati a ba na amya, akyo ata nza a ba na amya reh meh nati katsi ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Mya reh meh tamba nyi ma inza meh ti ba bu te ndohmoh ikpi amya kpeh, mya neh meh ba la meh ti lisa andromboh ata Ada amya nza a tohmoh meh reh a kira. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Ata areh a bu andromboh ata ŋoh nza a tohmoh meh reh a kira, la meh ti kama gu akyo anyi nimeh kyangwri mboh ata ŋoh nza a nga meh reh tavoh, a kira la mya reh meh ti a yiri mboh hinga ibi ata inziyo nza a nati a trina reh. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Ata areh a bu andromboh ata Ada amya nza a kira reh la, akyo ata nza a nza amehreh a ŋoh ta a nga ŋoh kira reh, a bu na fene ata tuma atono, mya meh nati a yiri ŋoh ibi ata inziyo nza a nati a trina reh.<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Yahudawa mboh maka a jiji a leh ka atsifa alulu ma ikpi Yeso reh tsifa la a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bu rya ata nza a tamba anyi ma inza reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Yahudawa mboh reh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu Yeso amehreh Yusufu ata Mbohroh nza meh wina akre tasa alehmeh reh kpeh? A lisa lele feh ŋoh sa a gyuru a bleh la. &lt;&lt;Mya meh tamba nyi ma inza&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kama tsifa nnoh alulu ma ikpi amya ma itoh amohnoh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />&lt;&lt;Akyo anyi a nati a wina ba na amya kpeh, nza a bu akyo ata Ada amya ata ŋoh nza a tohmoh meh reh a wa ŋoh a ba fya, tasa za meh nati a yiri ŋoh ibi ata inziyo areh nza a nati a trina reh. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />A bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh reh la, &lt;A bu Nnoh a nati a tsana noh nambri ma amohnoh.&gt; Akyo ata nza a sehreh tasa za ta a nza anyi na alehmeh reh, a nati a ba na amya. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Akyo anyi kǝ hehreh nza Ada reh kpeh, a bu ŋoh ata nza anyi na Nnoh reh mi, a bu ŋoh tsene ata kǝ nza Ada reh. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Meh bleh noh zizi, akyo ata nza a nga agohsoh na tsifa amya mboh reh, a bu na fene ata tuma atono. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Mya meh bu afohfohnoh ata nza a nati nga nnoh fene. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Ada amohnoh mboh tama a rya rya ata nza maka a fi la manna reh ma hohroh bini, mboh neh ma a kwo kukwi. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Nza akyo a rya rya ata neh nza anyi inza a ba reh, a nati a sohroh a kwo za kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Mya meh bu irya ata fene ata nza a tamba anyi inza reh, akyo ata nza a rya irya ata areh reh, a nati tuma atono. Irya ata areh reh a bu iwo itoh amya, ata nza ni nati de ba la inziyo reh ta a hunji fene&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Yahudawa mboh reh maka a leh ka yaha aniye ma itoh amoh maka luhu lala, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata areh a nati nga reh iwo itoh a ŋoh meh ti rya lele?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bleh noh zizi, nza ni rya nnoh iwo itoh amehreh kyangwri ti wa nnoh imya a ŋoh kpeh reh, ni nati hunji fene ma ikpi anzoh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />amboh ata nza ma a rya iwo itoh amya tasa za mata a wa imya amya reh ma a nati a bu na fene ata tuma atono, meh nati a yiri mboh hinga mata a hunji fene ibi ata trina reh. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Itoh amya reh a bu irya ata a zizi, imya amya za a bu amwo wa ata a zizi. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Amboh ata nza ma a rya iwo itoh amya reh tasa za mata a wa imya amya reh ma a tuma nimeh amya, mya za meh nati tuma nimeh amoh. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Tswanza Ada amya ata nza a bu na fene nza a tohmoh meh reh, a bu tsifa a ŋoh reh mya za meh bu na fene. Ma aki wohroh za akyo ata nza na a rya meh reh a nati a bu na fene tsifa amya. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ata areh a bu afohfohnoh ata nza a tamba anyi inza reh, a sohroh a tswanza afohfohnoh ata Ada amohnoh mboh ta maka a rya reh kpeh, tama a rya neh ma a gyuru a kwo yama. amboh ata nza ma a rya afohfohnoh ata areh ma a nati a bu na fene ata tuma atono.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yeso a bleh tsifa amboh areh ameh ata ŋoh ta ka a leh a tsana mboh nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh ma Kafarnahum reh.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsifa amboh Hunji Fene Ata Tuma Atono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Nza maka a sehreh dehreh, mgbiri amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Tsana ata areh a bu na iya, a bu anyi a nati a wina sa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yeso reh ka a wina la amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh ma a leh atsifa alulu ma ikpi tsana a ŋoh reh, ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ha tsana ata areh a kputu nnoh agohsoh? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Agohsoh amohnoh a nati ka bu lele nehnehreh, nza ni kǝ nza noh Amehreh kyangwri a buti ka a na ŋoh atsi ata ŋoh ta ka anyi reh? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />A bu huru ka a de fene a ba. Itoh a bu na wuwana ata lisa andromboh kpeh. Tsifa mboh ata mya nza ni leh bleh noh reh ma anyi na huru, tasa za ma a nati a nga noh fene. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Mgbiri amohnoh mboh neh ma a yama ata nza ma a nga agohsoh na tsifa amya mboh reh kpeh.&gt;&gt; Yeso tana a wina anyi jiji reh amboh ata nza ma a nati a nga agohsoh na a ŋoh kpeh reh tasa amboh ata nza ma a nati a de ŋoh a nga mboh reh. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />A ka a gyuru a bleh mboh za la, &lt;&lt;A bu tsifa wohroh mya nza ni bleh noh za la, akyo a nati a wina ba na amya kpeh, Ada amya a nati a kira ŋoh feh.<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />nza ka anyi na ameh ata areh reh, vara amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka ata ŋoh. Ma a za a tufa ŋoh za kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 6:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yeso ka luhu amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh za ni kira ti na amohnoh ta meh noh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Siman Abitrusu reh ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, meh nati na na anyi? A bu noh mi ni bu na tsifa ata nza a nati a de fene ata tuma atono ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />mbohroh meh nga agohsoh ambohroh, tasa za meh wina la ni bu ata zanana Nnoh<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh seh nnoh mohnoh agrumavoh hwa afri, anyimbehreh nimeh amohnoh a bu agugu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Ŋoh reh tana a leh atsifa ma ikpi Yahuda, amehreh Siman Iskariyoti, la a bu ŋoh ata nza a nati a de ŋoh a nga mboh reh, ŋoh reh tana a bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yeso Mboh Ma Atsini Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ata areh nza ka gǝga, Yeso ka a hehndeh a treh akpokpo inzizi mboh ma Galili, ŋoh neh ka a kira ta a hehndeh ma Yahudiya kpeh, tsifa la agbugba Yahudawa mboh nza ma a yama ma a huru reh ma a kira mata a mla ŋoh a kwo. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Kira johjoh la dasa Yahudawa mboh neh, kǝ ba nda, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />atsini Yeso mboh maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A zohhoh ti yi atsi ata areh ta, ti na anzoh Yahudiya, amboh tufa anzoh mboh reh mata a nza agbugba ndohmoh anzoh ata shi nza ŋara aniye ma ata nza ni kǝ lisa reh. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Akyo ata nza a kira la mata a wina ŋoh gaga a ka huho andromboh ata nza ka a lisa kpeh. Ni kǝ lisa andromboh amboh ata areh, tsana ikpi anzoh la inziyo ta a wina noh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Atsini Yeso mboh za kembese tama nga agohsoh na a ŋoh kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ameh mya hehreh ba kpeh; na amohnoh neh ha ka bu ameh atamaa a bu yehlehleh ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Inziyo ma a nati wina leke nnoh kpeh, neh a bu mya mi a buti leke, telema feh la meh bleh mboh tsifa ndohmoh agugu ata nza maka a lisa reh. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Mohnoh na nnoh kira johjoh reh. Mya meh nati na atsi kira johjoh reh nehnehreh kpeh, ameh amya hehreh su kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Nza ka a bleh mboh tsifa ata areh a ka a tuma ashidi ma Galili.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso Ma Atsi Kira La Dasa Yahudawa Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Atsini mboh neh nza maka a na amoh atsi kira johjoh reh, Yeso ka a ba ba a na na mgba huho ŋoh, a kira la akyo ta a nza ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Yahudawa mboh maka a leh a hehndeh a fa ŋoh ma atsi kira reh, maka a luhu la,&lt;&lt;ŋoh kyangwri reh ka bu ma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Nimeh duma agba reh kyangwri mboh ma a leh ka atsifa alulu na ayuhu ma itoh amoh ma ikpi Yeso. itswa la, &lt;&lt;A bu kyangwri alindeh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:12">mgbiri la, &lt;&lt;Uwa, a ka a hehndeh a landa kyangwri mboh mi&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Akyo neh a mishi atsifa a kate ma ikpi a ŋoh kpeh ma a nyiri Yahudawa mboh reh.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A tsana Ma Atsi Kira Johjoh Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Maka a te ma atsitsifi kira johjoh reh Yeso ka aniye ma ida Nnoh ka a buti tsana mboh. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Yahudawa mboh reh maka a shi a ŋara aniye ma tasa maka luhu la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata areh a sohroh a na atsi kpehkpehteh kpeh, ka a lisa lele sa a wina tsana ikata areh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Tsana amya reh a bu amya kpeh. Anyi na akyo ata nza tohmoh meh reh mi. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Nza akyo ata kira ta a shi a lisa andromboh ata Nnoh nza kira, a nati a wina la ha tsana amya reh anyi na Nnoh mi, anyi na amya kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Akyo ata nza ka a tsana andromboh ata ikpi a ŋoh reh, ka a lisa dehreh la ŋoh ta a nga ma ikpi a ŋoh agba, akyo neh ata nza ka kira la ŋoh ta a nga agba ma akyo ata nza a tohmoh ŋoh reh, a bu ŋoh mi kyangwri bleh zizi tasa za a bu na huru tsifa kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Musa tana a nga noh akpi Nnoh reh kpeh? akyo amohnoh anyi a sohroh a de akpi reh kpeh. A bu tsifa umbo feh ni kira ti mla meh noh kwo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Duma mboh reh maka kira la,&lt;&lt;Ni bu na huru inyo,&gt;&gt;&lt;&lt;A bu anyi ka a kira ta a mla nnoh a kwo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yeso a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh lisa ndohmoh agba anyimbehreh ma nambri ma amohnoh ni shi ŋara nnoh aniye ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa tana a bleh noh tsifa shimba kpa mara amoh mboh reh, a bu Musa tana a jiji a bleh tsifa reh kpeh, a bu ada amohnoh mboh amboh ata kiri mboh mi. neh ni kǝ shimba nnoh kpa ma mara amohnoh mboh ma ibi asabar. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Nza maka a wina shimba kpa ma amehreh ma ibi asabar tsifa la mata kama a kya akpi Musa reh kpeh, nza a bu dehreh, ni te nnoh gofo na amya tsifa nga ma itoh kyangwri hunji nana ma ibi asabar tsifa umbo? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Kama hwra noh akpi ma ikpi andromboh ata nza ma a nza na iyo ma kpeh, hwra noh akpi ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a bu zizi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bu Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Kyangwri Urushalima mboh amboh anyi maka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Areh a bu kyangwri ata nza ma a hehndeh a fa la mata a mla a kwo reh kpeh? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Nza ŋoh, atsi shi tsifa ma hohroh kyangwri mboh reh, ma a bleh ŋoh andromboh kpeh. Ha agbugba mboh reh ma a wina zizi la a bu ŋoh ŋa nza bu Kristi reh? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Mbohroh neh meh wina atsi ata kyangwri ata areh nza anyi reh; nza Kristi tana a ba reh, akyo a nati a wina atsi ata nza a nati anyi kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yeso nza ka a buti tsana nimeh ida Nnoh reh neh, ka a vuru agba ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mohnoh ni wina meh noh, ni wina noh atsi ata mya nza meh nyi. meh ba atsi reh bu ata ikpi mya kpeh, akyo neh ata nza a tohmoh meh a bu zizi. Ni wina noh kpeh, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Mya neh meh wina ŋoh tsifa la meh nyi na a ŋoh ta ka a tohmoh meh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Yeso nza ka a bleh tsifa ata areh, kyangwri mboh reh maka a fa la mata a de ŋoh. Akyo neh a sohroh a bara ŋoh kpeh tsifa la ameh a ŋoh kǝ hehreh ba. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Nambri dehreh, vara kyangwri mboh gaga nimeh duma agba reh maka a nga kira ma Yeso, maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Na ameh ata Kristi a nati a ba reh, a nati a lisa ndohmoh ŋara aniye a keh ata kyangwri ata areh nza a lisa reh?<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A de Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Farisiyawa mboh maka a sehreh kyangwri mboh atsifa ma ashotoh ma itoh amoh ma ikpi Yeso. Ma a huru agbugba Firist mboh tasa Farisiyawa mboh maka a bleh ma amboh sumu ida Nnoh la mata a de ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bu na amohnoh na ameh shidi ma, meh nati na na akyo ata nza a tohmoh meh. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Ni nati fa meh noh mohnoh neh ni nati hunji meh noh kpeh; tasa atsi ata mya meh nati yama, ni nati wina ba nnoh a huru kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Yahudawa mboh maka atsifa ma itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata areh a ka a na ama feh la meh nati fa ŋoh hunji kpeh? Ha a nati a na atsi ata kyangwri ambohroh mboh nza ma a sangrana atsetse nza ma a tuma mboh ma amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, tasa za ta ka a tsana amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh ma ari? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Ka a bleh la mboh nza a bleh la, &lt;Ni nati fa meh noh, mohnoh neh ni nati hunji meh noh kpeh,&gt; tasa &lt;Atsi meh nati yama, ni nati wina ba nnoh kpeh&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amwo Ata Nza ka A nga Fene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Ibi ata trina tasa bu ibi kira johjoh agba a ŋoh reh, Yeso ka a hinga a shi a vuru agba a bleh mama la, &lt;&lt;Nza akyo yohroh amwo a keh ŋoh, ta a ba na amya ba a wa. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Akyo ata nza a nga kira a ŋoh na amya, tswanza Amgbasho Nnoh nza a bleh la, Amwo mboh ata nza maka a nga fene ma a nati a tana a kate nyi ma yira ŋoh.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yeso a buti tsifa ma ikpi Huru Ata Zanana reh, amboh ata nza ma a nga kira amoh na a ŋoh ma a nati sa, la na ameh ata areh ma a hehreh a nga Huru Ata Zanana reh kpeh, tsifa la ma a hehreh a nga agba ma Yeso kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gafana Kyangwri Mboh Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Kyangwri mboh nza maka a sehreh tsifa ata Yeso nza a bleh reh, maka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Areh bu Kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh zizi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Mgbiri tswa ma a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu Kristi reh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">amboh tswa ma a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Kristi reh a nati a kate anyi Galili a ba kpeh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />A bu ŋa ma amgbasho Nnoh la Kristi a nati a kate anyi ma alohsoh Dawuda kpeh? A nati a kate anyi Batalami, akpo afiya Dawuda nza a tuma kpeh? <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Kyangwri mboh reh maka a gafana tsifa Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Mgbiri ma a kira mata a de ŋoh, akyo neh a kama a bara ŋoh kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agbugba Yahudawa Mboh Ma A nga Kira Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />amboh sumu mboh nza maka a ba amoh reh, Agba Firist mboh tasa agbugba Farisiyawa mboh maka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;A bu mboh a te feh ni de noh ba ma mareh kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />amboh sumu mboh reh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo a mishi atsifa tswanza kyangwri ata areh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Farisiyawa mboh reh maka a bleh ma amboh sumu mboh reh la, Areh ni tsana noh la mohnoh za a landa nnoh? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Ha akyo nimeh agbugba ha Farisiyawa mboh a yama nza ma nga agohsoh amoh na a ŋoh? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Uwa! neh dohsohna gaga ata areh amboh nza ma a wina andromboh ma ikpi tsana amgbasho akpi kpeh, ma a bu amboh aniye nza a de mboh mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodimus neh, nza a na na Yeso na amehmeh reh tana a bu nimeh amoh, ka a bleh mboh la, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />&lt;&lt;Tsana ata ambohroh reh a bleh reh la meh nati wina hwra akpi ma akyo kpeh, meh nati jiji sere nyi ma aniye a ŋoh feh, ma sa a wina andromboh nza a buti lisa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Maka a sa ŋoh aniye la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu kyangwri Galili za? Bleh amgbasho Nnoh nza ma a ŋa reh nza, Kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh nyi na Nnoh a bleh a nati mishi a kate anyi Galili kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Afya Ata Nza ma A de ŋoh Tsifa Leh Ahohndoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Kyangwri mboh reh nambri maka a na amoh afiya.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Afya Ata Nza ma A de ŋoh Tsifa Leh Ahohndoh Na Akyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Kyangwri mboh reh nambri maka a na amoh afiya. Yeso neh ka a na a ŋoh agbohgboh agbeh akpehngeh. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Ni nerebi shini ka a gyuru aniye ma ida Nnoh. Kyangwri mboh nambri maka a ba na a ŋoh, ka a tuma a tsana mboh. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Amboh tsana akpi Musa reh tasa Farisiyawa mboh maka a wa afya anyi a ba ata nza ma a de atsi leh ahohndoh na akyo. Maka a bleh ŋoh la ta a shi ma atsitsifi amoh. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Tasa maka a bleh Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, afya ata areh ma a de ŋoh ma atsi leh ahohndoh na akyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Nimeh amgbasho Musa ma a nga reh aniye la mata a dadafa biroh Afya ikata reh na kpakpa kwo. Ni bleh la umbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Ma a luhu dehreh la mboh mata a tsara ŋoh a nza, la mata a hunji a de ŋoh ma ikpi wohroh. Yeso neh ka a susuna a tamba ta ka a buti ŋa ma inzi na ameh ivoh a ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Nza maka a leh a luhu Yeso tsifa mboh, a ka a hinga a shi ta ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a wina la ŋoh a bu na kpakpana kpeh ta a jiji a fi kpakpa a na ma itoh afya reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Ka a gyuru a susuna a tamba za, ka a buti ŋa ma inzi.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Nza maka sehreh dehreh, maka a buti na amoh ma anyinyimbehreh, ka a nyi na agbugba kyangwri mboh ka a na na a wa akǝkehreh amoh mboh, maka a yi Yeso ŋoh tsene ata, tasa afya reh ma atsi shi ma tohmoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yeso ka a hinga a shi, ka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Afya, umbo ama? Akyo a sohroh a lofo nnoh kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Afya reh ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ada, akyo a yama kpeh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh nati lofo nnoh za kpeh, na anzoh ti kama kpakpana za kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bu Zana Inziyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yeso nza ka a gyuru atsifa na kyangwri mboh reh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya bu zana ata inziyo. Akyo ata nza a tufa meh a nati a mishi a hehndeh ma shini kpeh, Ŋoh neh ka a nati a hunji zana fene,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Farisiyawa mboh maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Tsifa anzoh ata areh a bu ata ikpi anzoh, tsifa reh a bu zizi kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ha meh tsifa reh ata ikpi amya, tsifa reh a bu zizi meh bleh, Mya meh wina atsi ata meh nyi tasa atsi mya meh buti na. mohnoh neh ni sohroh wina noh atsi mya nza ni nyi ha atsi mya nza ni buti na kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />mohnoh ni hwra noh akpi ni mgba kyangwri mboh; mya meh hwra akpi ma akyo kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Nza neh meh a nati hwra akpi reh, hwra akpi amya reh a bu zizi, a bu mya tsimya kpeh. meh shi na Ada, ata nza a tohmoh meh. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />A bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho tsana amohnoh reh la, nza kyangwri mboh afri ma a bleh tsifa a na ika wohroh yehlehleh, andromboh ata nza ma a bleh reh a bu zizi. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Meh bu akyo bleh tsifa ata ikpi amya; Ada ata nza a tohmoh meh ŋoh atsifa ma ikpi amya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Maka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ŋoh atsiyoh bu ma?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ni wina meh noh ha Ada kpeh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Nza ni nza meh noh, ni nati wina noh Ada za.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yeso a bleh tsifa ata areh na ameh ata nza leh a tsana nimeh ida Nnoh, ma atsi gya hungroh. Akyo a wina de ŋoh kpeh, tsifa la ameh ŋoh kǝ hehreh su kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ni Nati Wina Na Nnoh Atsi Na Amya Reh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yeso ka a gyuru a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati na amya, ni nati fa meh noh, ni nati kwo nnoh nimeh kpakpana amohnoh, atsi ata meh na reh, ni nati wina ba a huru kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Agbugba Yahudawa mboh maka a sehreh tsifa ata areh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ŋoh ka a nati a mla ikpi a ŋoh a kwo? Bu wohroh nza a bleh la, Atsi ata Meh na, ni nati wina ba nnoh kpeh&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yeso neh ka a buti rya tohmoh na bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mohnoh na bu noh amboh ata inzi mboh, mya meh nyi inza mi. Ni bu noh amboh ata inziyo mboh; Mya meh bu ata inziyo kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Meh bleh noh la ni nati kwo nnoh nimeh kpakpana amohnoh mboh; nza ni nga nnoh kira la, a bu Mya wohroh meh nza bleh noh la meh bu mya wohroh kpeh, ni nati kwo nnoh nimeh kpakpana amohnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Maka luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ bu anyi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Bu mya wohroh mya nza bleh noh nyi jiji ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Meh bu na tsifa gaga ata meh nati wina bleh ma ikpi anzoh, meh ti hwra noh akpi za. Akyo ata nza tohmoh meh reh, ka a bleh zizi, tasa za meh nati bleh inziyo andromboh ata meh sere nyi na &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Ma a sohroh a sehreh a wina la a buti bleh mboh tsifa ma ikpi Alehmeh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Na ameh ata nza ni nati gu nnoh Amehreh Kyangwri gya ka nnoh reh, a huru ni nati wina noh la bu Mya wohroh reh, tasa la meh kǝ lisa andromboh ata ikpi mya, mya neh meh kǝ bleh andromboh ata Ada nza a tsana meh. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Akyo ata nza a tohmoh meh a bu na amya, ata meh mya tsimya kpeh, la meh kǝ lisa andromboh ata nza a kira na tutu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Na ameh ata nza a buti bleh tsifa mboh reh, kyangwri mboh gaga maka nga agohsoh amoh na a ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zizi A nati A sa Nnoh A hwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yeso ka a bleh ma Yahudawa mboh amboh nza ma a sa tsifa reh kira la, &lt;&lt;Nza ni rya nnoh tomo ti de noh tsana amya reh, ni bu noh amboh tufa amya mboh ata a zizi. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Ni nati wina zizi, zizi reh a nati a sa noh a hwana,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Maka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh bu alohsoh Ibrahim mi, meh hehreh te ahwra ma akyo kpeh. A te lele feh ni bleh reh la, meh nati hunji &lt;&lt;Nvara?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yeso ka kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi, akyo ata nza ka a kpakpana a bu ahwra ma kpakpana reh, <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Ahwra ka a bu na atsifi ma afiya kpeh, amehreh neh a bu ŋoh na atsifi tswa atsi tuma atono. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Nza Amehreh a ŋoh reh kǝ sa noh hwana, ni nati hunji noh nvara ata a zizi. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Meh wina la ni bu noh alohsoh Ibrahim mboh. mohnoh neh ni kira ti mla meh noh kwo, tsifa la ni sohroh sa nnoh tsana ata amya reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Meh bleh noh andromboh ata meh nza nyi na ada, mohnoh neh ni lisa noh andromboh ata nza ni sehreh nyi nnoh na atsiyoh amohnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Maka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ibrahim a bu ada ambohroh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Bu ma bleh la ni bu noh mara Ibrahim mboh zizi reh, bu ni lisa noh andromboh ata ŋoh Ibrahim nza a lisa. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Mya meh bu kyangwri bleh zizi andromboh ata meh sehreh nyi ni Nnoh, mohnoh neh ni hende fa nnoh aki ti mla meh noh kwo, Ibrahim tana lisa dehreh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Mohnoh ni lisa noh andromboh ata atsiyoh amohnoh taka a lisa reh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">&lt;&lt;Yahudawa mboh reh neh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh bu mara inyo mboh kpeh. A bu Nnoh mi ŋoh bu Ada ata nza meh bu na wohroh.&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mara Agugu mboh Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yeso ka a nga mboh kira la, &lt;&lt;Mata a bleh la, Nnoh bu Atsiyoh amohnoh, bu ni kira nnoh na amya, tsifa la mya meh nyi na Nnoh, nehnehreh nza mya uweh. Meh ba ata ikpi amya kpeh; ŋoh neh a tohmoh meh. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Ka bu mboh a te ni sohroh sehreh noh tsifa amya wina noh kpeh? Tsifa la ni sohroh shi ti sehreh noh andromboh ata mya nza meh bleh reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />mohnoh ni bu noh ata atsiyoh amohnoh agugu reh, tasa kira ti lisa nnoh andromboh ata ŋoh nza a kira. ŋoh a bu kyangwri mla kyangwri mboh kwo nyi jiji ŋoh, andromboh a wa aniye na bleh zizi kpeh, nza a nati bleh huru tsifa a ka atsifa na arimi mgba a ŋoh, ŋoh a bu kyangwri huru tsifa akre amboh agugu mboh. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Mya neh meh bleh noh zizi reh kavoh, ni sohroh sa tsifa reh kira nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />A bu anyi nimeh amohnoh a nati shi a tsana la mya meh bu na kpakpana ma akpo anyi? Nza meh kǝ bleh noh zizi reh, a bu umbo a te feh ni sohroh sa tsifa amya reh kira noh kpeh? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Akyo ata nza a bu ata Nnoh a ŋoh ka a sehreh andromboh ata Nnoh nza ka a bleh. Tsifa ata nza kǝ sere nnoh kpeh ni bu noh ata Nnoh a ŋoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A keh Ibrahim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Yahudawa mboh reh maka kira la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh bleh zizi kpeh, nza meh bleh noh la, nnoh bu kyangwri Samariya reh ata nza a bu na huru inyo reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh sohroh bu na huru inyo kpeh, &lt;&lt;Mya neh meh nga agba ma Ada mohnoh ni sohroh nga meh noh agba kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Bu mya meh fa nga agba ma ikpi amya kpeh; akyo anyi a yama ata nza a nati a fa nga meh bu ŋoh mi kyangwri hwra akpi. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Meh bleh noh zizi, akyo ata nza a tufa tsifa amya a nati a kwo kpeh a nati tuma atono.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Yahudawa mboh reh nza maka a sehreh dehreh, maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nehnehreh Mbohroh ma kǝ wina la, ni bu na huru inyo! Ibrahim tasa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh tama a kwo, Nnoh neh ni shi bleh la, &lt;Akyo ata nza a tufa aki tsana ata anzoh, a nati a mishi a kwo kpeh.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ni keh ada ambohroh Ibrahim? A kwo, amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh za maka a kwo. Nza anzoh ni kǝ keh anyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yeso ka kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nza meh nga agba ma ikpi amya, nga ata areh reh ba wusu ma. Akyo ata nza nga agba reh bu Ada, ata mohnoh nza ni bleh la bu Nnoh amohnoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />mohnoh ni sohroh wina ŋoh kpeh, mya neh meh wina ŋoh. Mata a bleh la meh bleh la meh wina ŋoh kpeh, bu meh tuma kyangwri huru tsifa tswanza mohnoh. Mya neh meh wina ŋoh, meh kǝ nga ŋoh agba ma ikpi andromboh ata nza ka a bleh. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Agohsoh Ibrahim a kasa gaga nza a nza ahushi amya amboh ata areh; a nza na iyo a ŋoh, agohsoh a ŋoh ka a kasa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Yahudawa mboh reh maka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ahushi anzoh kǝ hehreh tswa agrumavoh ida atungu kpeh, ni buti bleh la ni nza Ibrahim?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi la, neh ma a sohroh a mara Ibrahim kpeh, meh yama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Yeso nza ka a bleh tsifa ata areh, maka a fira kpakpa mboh la mata a dadafa ŋoh. Yeso ka a huho ikpi a ŋoh, ka a kate a yi ida Nnoh reh ata.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A vuru iyo Ma Kyangwri Anyi A hama iyo Nyi Yira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yeso nza ka a buti hende, a ka a nza kyangwri anyi a hama iyo anyi avoh mara a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a luhu ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Kyangwri Tsana, ka bu kpakpana anyi nza a te nza ma a mara kyangwri reh na hama iyo ma dehreh? A bu kpakpana a ŋoh ha a bu alehmeh a ŋoh mboh amoh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Hama iyo kyangwri reh a bu na andromboh nza a nati te na kpakpana a ŋoh ha alehmeh mboh amoh kpeh. A hama iyo reh la mata a tsana wuwana ndohmoh Nnoh ma ikpi a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />A bu kanga, meh nati te ndohmoh akyo ata nza a tohmoh meh reh neh mgbiri nnoh a treh a yama, shini wa a ba ameh ata akyo a nati sohroh wina te ndohmoh za kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Mya ti kǝ tre bu ma inziyo areh, meh bu zana ata inziyo&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Yeso nza ka a bleh dehreh a treh, a ka a tohfoh ata ma inzi, ta ka a toho avru na ata reh, ta ka a kpishi avru ata ŋoh nza toho reh, ka a wo a na ma iyo kyangwri reh. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Ka a bleh ma kyangwri reh la, &lt;&lt;Na ni hwara iyo anzoh ma amwo kaǝkaereh Siluwam reh&gt;&gt;Areh ka a tsana la a bu &lt;&lt;Tohmoh&gt;&gt; Kyangwri reh ka a na na a hwara iyo a ŋoh, ta ka a gyuru a ba a ŋoh afya, iyo a ŋoh kǝ te nza a ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Atohngoh a ŋoh mboh amboh ata nza ma a wina ŋoh atsi hende a kwere na amehmeh reh maka luhu la, &lt;&lt;Areh bu kyangwri ata nza ka a tuma a kwere reh kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Mgbiri ma a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu ŋoh,&gt;&gt; mgbiri tswa neh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Uwa a bu ŋoh kpeh a za ka a tswanza ŋoh reh ma.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Kyangwri reh na ikpi a ŋoh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu mya kyangwri wohroh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Maka luhu ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Maka a lisa lele feh iyo anzoh sa a vuruna a nza reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Ka a kira mboh la,&lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata nza maka a fi ŋoh la Yeso reh bu ŋoh mi a tohfoh avru, ka a wo meh ma iyo, ta ka a bleh meh la, meh ti na ni hwara tohmoh amya ma amwo tsitsiyo Siluwam. Meh kǝ na ni hwara iyo amya reh ka a vuruna a nza atsifi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ŋoh ama?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Meh wina kpeh,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Farisiyawa Mboh Ma A hehndeh A fa Chuhu Tsifa Vuru iyo Kyangwri Hama iyo Reh A nza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />kyangwri mboh maka a wa kyangwri nza ta ka hama iyo reh a na na Farisiyawa mboh. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Ibi ata Yeso nza toho avru a vuru iyo kyangwri reh a bu ibi Asabar. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Farisiyawa mboh reh maka a gyuru a luhu kyangwri reh la, ta a bleh mboh a bu lele feh nza ka a hunji a nza atsifi reh. &lt;&lt;Ka a tohfoh avru ta ka awo meh ma iyo; meh kǝ hwara tohmoh amya na amwo, iyo amya ka a vuruna a nza atsifi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Mgbiri Farisiyawa mboh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata nza a lisa andromboh ata areh a nati a mishi anyi na Nnoh kpeh, a sohroh a nga agba ma ibi asabar kpeh,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Mgbiri tswa za maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A nati lisa lele kyangwri ata nza a bu na kpakpana ta wina lisa agbugba awumu ŋara aniye ma ikata areh?&gt;&gt; Kohnoh amoh ka a greshina ma itoh amoh.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Farisiyawa mboh reh maka a gyuru a luhu kyangwri reh za la, &lt;&lt;A ka bu umbo? a bu kohnoh anzoh ma ikpi kyangwri ata nza vuru iyo anzoh reh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Kyangwri reh ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;A bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Agbugba Yahudawa mboh reh neh, ma mishi a nga agohsoh amoh kpeh la kyangwri areh tana a bu kyangwri hama iyo la nehnehreh ŋoh kǝ nza, nza maka a fi alehmeh a ŋoh mboh a ba feh <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />maka a luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Areh a bu amehreh amohnoh? Ni bleh noh la tama a mara ŋoh na hama iyo ma; a bu lele feh sa a hunji a nza nehnehreh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Alehmeh a ŋoh mboh reh maka kira la, Mbohroh meh wina la a bu amehreh ambohroh tasa za tama a mara ŋoh na hama iyo ma. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />mbohroh neh meh sohroh wina ha ka bu lele nehnehreh ka a hunji nza atsifi reh kpeh, ha la meh ti wina la a ka bu anyi ka a vuru iyo a ŋoh nza a hunji nza atsifi reh kpeh. Luhu nnoh; ŋoh a za a bu amehreh akehreh kpeh, a nati a wina a vuru aniye a bleh na ikpi a ŋoh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Alehmeh a ŋoh mboh reh ma a bleh tsifa ata areh tsifa la, ma a nyiri agbugba Yahudawa mboh maka atsifa a gya la, akyo ata nza a bleh tasa ta a nga agohsoh la a bu Yeso a bu ŋoh Kristi reh, ma a nati a katsi ŋoh a kate anyi nimeh ida Nnoh amoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />A bu tsifa wohroh alehmeh a ŋoh mboh reh ma a bleh la,&lt;&lt;A za bu amehreh akehreh kpeh; luhu nnoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Farisiyawa mboh reh maka a gyuru a fi kyangwri ata ta ka a hama iyo reh a ba a te na afri ma ta ka luhu ŋoh la, riri a bu na Nnoh.&lt;&lt;Bleh reh zizi bu na nimeh isa Nnoh! Mbohroh meh wina la kyangwri ata nza a vuru iyo anzoh a nza atsifi reh a bu kyangwri kpakpana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Kyangwri reh a ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh kama wina ha a bu kyangwri kpakpana kpeh, andromboh anyimbehreh ata mya nza meh wina reh a bu la: Mya tini bu kyangwri hama iyo, nehnehreh meh buti nza atsifi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Maka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;A ka a lisa nnoh umbo?&gt;&gt; A ka lisa lele feh sa a de iyo anzoh a nza atsifi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Meh tini jiji bleh noh, ni sohroh sa kira meh noh kpeh. Ni kira ti sehreh noh umbo za na amya? Ha mohnoh za ni kira ti bu noh amboh tufa a ŋoh umbo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Agbugba Yahudawa mboh maka a kya kyangwri reh a de aniye a wuwa la, &lt;&lt;A bu noh mi ni bu kyangwri tufa a ŋoh, mbohroh neh meh bu amboh tufa Musa mi. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Meh wina la Nnoh tana tsifa na Musa mi; kyangwri ata areh neh meh sohroh wina atsi ata nza anyi reh kpeh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Kyangwri reh ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Areh a bu andromboh afeh! ni wina noh atsi ata nza anyi kpeh, nza noh a vuru iyo amya! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Meh wina la Nnoh ka sehreh amboh kpakpana mboh kpeh; a ka a sehreh amboh nza maka nga ŋoh agba tasa maka a lisa andromboh ata ŋoh nza a kira la mata a lisa ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Nyi jiji inziyo agba areh ma a sohroh a sehreh la akyo a vuru iyo akyo ata nza ma a mara ŋoh anyi yira na hama iyo ma kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Ma a bleh la kyangwri reh a sohroh anyi na Nnoh kpeh, ma a sohroh a wina lisa andromboh ika ata areh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Maka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Tama a mara nnoh ni hinga te agba nimeh kpakpana, ni fa la ti shi tsana reh?&gt;&gt; Maka a katsi ŋoh a kate anyi nimeh ida Nnoh reh.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hama iyo Ata Huru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yeso nza ka a sehreh la ma katsi ŋoh. nza ka a hunji kyangwri reh, Ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni nga agohsoh na Amehreh Kyangwri reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Kyangwri reh ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri agba, ŋoh bu anyi? bleh meh mya ti nga agohsoh na a ŋoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni jiji nza ŋoh, a bu ŋoh nza a shi a tsifa na anzoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Kyangwri reh ka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Ada, meh nga agohsoh, ka a susuna ma tohmoh Yeso ta ka a krumusu ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh ba ma inziyo areh la meh ti hwra akpi, la amboh ata nza ma a hama iyo mata a hunji a nza tasa amboh nza ma a nza reh iyo amoh ta hamana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mgbiri Farisiyawa mboh nza ma a yama ma a huru na a ŋoh reh maka a sehreh ŋoh atsi bleh tsifa ata areh maka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bleh la meh bu amboh hama iyo mboh za?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mata a bleh la mohnoh ni bu noh amboh hama iyo mboh bu ni bu noh ni kpakpana kpeh; mohnoh neh ni bleh noh la ni kǝ nza noh, kpakpana amohnoh reh a treh a yama yivoh<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Kyangwri Sumu Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yeso a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi: akyo ata nza a gǝga na mgba anida kpeh, ta ka a gǝga mgba anyi aniye a na ma ikpukpu atashi mboh, akyo reh a bu ayuhu, a bu kyangwri sa awumu kyangwri a hwa na na wuwana. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Akyo ata nza a gǝga na mgba anida reh a bu ŋoh mi nza a bu kyangwri sumu atashi mboh reh. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Kyangwri shi sumu anida reh ka a vuru ŋoh anida; atashi mboh maka a sehreh agba ŋoh tswanza nza ka a fi mboh na isa amoh mboh reh, ta ka a wa mboh a kate a na inziyo. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Nza kǝ wa mboh kate reh, a ka a na tohmoh na amoh, atashi mboh reh mata a tufa ŋoh, tsifa la ma a sehreh agba ŋoh a wina. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ma a nati tufa agba sehneh kpeh; neh, ma a nati a gbo a nyiri akyo wohroh tsifa la ma a sohroh a sehreh agba a ŋoh a wina kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh kakranda ata areh, mboh neh ma a sohroh a sehreh a wina kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bu Kyangwri Sumu Alindeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yeso ka a gyuru a bleh mboh za la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi: Meh bu anida ata atashi mboh maka aniye reh. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />amboh ata nza ma a jiji a ba na amya reh ma a bu ayuhu mboh tasa amboh vasa atsifi mboh, atashi mboh reh neh ma a sohroh a shi a sehreh mboh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Mya meh bu anida. amboh ata nza ma aniye a gǝga na amya ma a nati a hunji nvara, a nati a gǝga a kate ta a gyuru a gǝga aniye a na nimeh a hehndeh a fa irya. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Ayuhu a ka a ba mi la, ŋoh ta a te ayuhu, tasa ta a mla akyo a kwo, tasa ta a lofo. Meh ba neh la ti hunji noh fene ata tuma atono. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Yeso a bleh la meh bu kyangwri sumu alindeh, ata nza a nati a kira ta a gu fene a ŋoh ma ikpi atashi mboh reh. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Nza ma a gu kyangwri ndohmoh anyi tse la ta a ba ba a sumu atashi mboh reh, a bu ŋoh ka a sumu mboh kpeh, atashi mboh reh ma bu a ŋoh kpeh. Nza maka a nza ava aye atsi ba, ka a gbo a na a ŋoh ata atashi mboh reh, ava aye reh ka a de atashi reh ta ka a katsi mgbiri mboh maka a sangrana a treh atsifi. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Kyangwri ndohmoh nza ma a gu ŋoh kohfoh reh ka a gbo a na a ŋoh tsifa la ma za ka a gu ŋoh kohfoh ma, andromboh a wa a ŋoh aniye na atashi mboh reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Meh bu kyangwri sumu alindeh. Meh wina amya, amya mboh za ma a wina meh. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Tswanza mya nza ni wina Ada reh, Ada za a wina meh. Tasa za meh nati wina gu fene amya tsifa atashi mboh. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Mgbiri atashi mboh ma a yama amboh ata nza ma a bu amya mboh ma a yama nimeh kpukpu atashi ata areh kpeh. Meh nati fa mboh ba kanga, ma a nati a sehreh agba amya, ma a nati a bu vara anyimbehreh mata bu na kyangwri sumu anyimbehreh za. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />&lt;&lt;Bu tsifa wohroh Ada nza a kira na amya reh, tsifa la meh nga fene amya, la meh nati gyuru hunji yama. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Akyo a nati a wina sa fene amya a hwana kpeh. Tsifa la bu mya na ikpi amya meh kǝ nga fene were. Meh bu na wuwana meh ti nga fene amya, tasa meh bu na wuwana gu fene amya za. Areh a bu andromboh ata Ada nza a bleh meh la meh ti lisa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Ma ikpi tsifa ata areh Yeso nza a bleh reh Yahudawa mboh reh maka a shi atsi kpa aniye na itoh amoh. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Gaga nimeh amoh mboh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu na huru inyo! A te a kwere! Ni sere nnoh tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Itswa neh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri a kwere a nati a wina tsifa dehreh! lele feh inyo sa a wina vuru iyo ma kyangwri umbo?<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yahudawa Mboh ma A leke Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Tana bu na ameh awo ma buti kira johjoh Nga Ida Nnoh ma Urushalima. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yeso a buti hende ma akpo anyi maka a fi la kpakpranda Solomon nimeh Ida Nnoh, <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Kyangwri Yahudawa mboh nza maka a dohsohna a goh ŋoh maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A nati a gu ahushi amama ni leh gu agohsoh ambohroh gya ka? Bleh reh zizi: ni bu Kristi reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bleh noh mohnoh neh ni sohroh nga nnoh kira kpeh. Ndohmoh mya nza kǝ lisa nimeh isa Ada a tswa ta bleh tsifa ma ikpi mya; <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />mohnoh neh ni nga nnoh kira kpeh, la mohnoh ni bu noh nimeh avavara atashi amya mboh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Atashi amya mboh maka a sehreh agba amya; Meh wina mboh, tasa maka a tufa meh. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Meh nga mboh fene ata tuma atono, tasa ma a nati a mishi a kwo kpeh. Akyo a nati wina sa mboh a hwana anyi na amya kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Andromboh ata Ada amya nza a nga meh reh a bu agba a keh awumu mboh reh nambri, akyo a nati a wina sa mboh a hwana anyi ma ivoh Ada amya kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Ada amya reh tasa mya meh bu anyimbehreh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Yahudawa mboh reh ma a gyuru a fira kpakpa za la mboh mata a dadafa ŋoh: <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh lisa ndohmoh mboh alilehndeh ma tohmoh amohnoh ata Ada nza a nga meh la meh ti lisa; a bu ma ikpi atamaa ni kira ti dadafa meh noh reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Yahudawa mboh reh maka kira la, &lt;&lt;Meh kira meh ti dadafa nnoh tsifa ndohmoh alilehndeh mboh nza ni lisa mboh reh kpeh, neh ka bu tsifa nza ni a kya Nnoh reh mi! Ni bu kyangwri ma, nnoh neh ni kira ti gu ikpi anzoh la ni bu Nnoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu ŋa gya ma amgbasho akpi amohnoh la, Nnoh a bleh la, &lt;Ni bu noh nnoh akǝkehreh mboh.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Mbohroh meh wina la andromboh ata nza a bu nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh a bu zizi a nati tuma atono; tasa Nnoh a bleh la kyangwri mboh amboh wohroh ma a bu noh akǝkehreh mboh, kyangwri mboh amboh ata nza ma a nga mboh tohmoh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Mya reh meh bu ata Ada nza a seh meh ta a tohmoh meh a ba inziyo reh. A bu lele feh ni bleh meh noh la meh kya Nnoh amya tsifa ata mya nza ni bleh la meh bu Amehreh Nnoh reh? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Kama nga noh kira na amya kpeh, nza meh leke meh ti te ndohmoh Ada mya nza a bleh la meh ti lisa reh. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Nza neh meh lisa mboh, ha ni nga nnoh kira na amya, nga agohsoh na ndohmoh mboh reh, la ti wina noh, ti sehreh wina noh la, Ada bu nimeh amya, mya za nimeh Ada.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Maka a kira za la mboh mata a gyuru a de Yeso, neh a ka a wrofona a kate ma ivoh amoh.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yeso ka a gyuru a hwana a na na iba fini Urdu ma atsi ata Ayohana ta ka a jiji a wra ŋoh batisma reh, a ka a tuma ma a huru. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Kyangwri mboh gaga maka a ba na a ŋoh maka a bleh ŋoh la.&lt;&lt;Ayohana a mishi a lisa ndohmoh ŋara aniye kpeh, neh tsifa mboh nza a bleh ma ikpi kyangwri reh a bu zizi nambri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Kyangwri mboh gaga ma a huru maka nga agohsoh na Yeso.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Kwo Lazarus Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Kyangwri anyi isa a ŋoh bu Lazarus, a tuma ma Betani, ka a leh bishi. Betani reh a bu akpo afiya ata Maryamu tasa Afi Marta ma tuma. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Maryamu reh bu ŋoh ta ka a wo amehneh wo ata nza a fi angǝshi alindeh ma hwana Ada reh tasa ta ka a firu mboh nashi na ikpi a ŋoh; Lazarus nza a leh bishi reh a bu asra a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Asra ŋoh mboh reh maka a tohmoh a na na Yeso: &lt;&lt;Ada, iza anzoh ata nza ni kira na a ŋoh reh a leh bishi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yeso nza ka a sehreh dehreh, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Bishi a ŋoh ata areh a nati a gu ŋoh a na ta a kwo kpeh, neh ka a nati a de nga agba ma Nnoh tasa za mata a nga agba ma Amehreh a ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yeso a kira na Marta reh tasa afi tasa Lazarus. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Nza a sehreh tsifa reh dehreh neh la Lazarus a leh bishi, a lisa a tuma a te ibi afri ma atsi ŋoh nza a bu reh <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Ma huru ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ba turoh meh ti gyuru na ambohroh Yahudiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka kira la,&lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana,&gt;&gt;&lt;&lt;A bu na mgba tunu areh Yahudawa mboh reh tama a kira la mata a dadafa nnoh na kpakpa; ni fa la ti gyuru na a huru?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yeso ka a kira la,&lt;&lt;Ibi anyimbehreh a bu na ameh agrumavoh a hwa afri kpeh? amboh nza maka a hehndeh na zana nnoh a ka a kpa hwana kpeh, tsifa la maka a nza zana ata inziyo areh. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Akyo neh ata nza a hehndeh nashi ni maka a kpa hwana, tsifa la ma bu na shira nza atsifi kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yeso ka a bleh tsifa mboh reh a treh, ka a gyuru a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Iza ambohroh Lazarus a leh mla, mya neh meh kira meh ti na ni a yiri ŋoh ta a hinga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka kira la,&lt;&lt;Nza a bu mla a gu ŋoh reh, Ada, A nati a nga ŋoh wuwana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yeso a buti bleh mboh la Lazarus reh kǝ kwo, mboh neh ma a gu la bu mla a zizi. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh a kate la, &lt;&lt;Lazarus reh kǝ kwo, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />A bu tsifa amohnoh mi a nga meh nana agohsoh meh sohroh yama ma a huru kpeh, tsifa la ti nga nnoh kira. Ba turoh meh na na a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Toma (ata nza maka a fi ŋoh la sehfeh reh) ka a bleh ma amoh mboh amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ba turoh meh ti wa kyangwri tsana reh na, la meh ti kwo ma a ŋoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso Bu Hinga amboh Kwo Tasa Fene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yeso nza ka a ba ba aniye, ka a hunji la maa anyifo Lazarus ma ikpi nyifo, kǝ te ibi anneh nehnehreh. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Betani reh a bu nda na Urushalima ma a sohroh a tswa mel afri kpeh, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Yahudawa mboh gaga maka a ba ba atsifa na Marta tasa Maryamu aniye kwo asra amoh reh.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Marta nza ka a sehreh la Yeso a buti ba, ka a kate ka a na na a hunji ŋoh, Maryamu neh ka a tuma a ŋoh ma mgba afiya. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Marta ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Bu ma a bleh la ni yama ma mareh, Ada, Asra amya ma a sohroh a kwo kpeh! <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Mya neh meh wina la nehnehreh dehreh Nnoh a nati nga nnoh andromboh ata nza ni luhu ŋoh nambri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Asra anzoh a nati a hinga a fene yama,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh wina la a nati a hinga a fene ma ibi ata trina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Mya bu hinga amboh nza ma a kwo tasa amboh fene. amboh nza ma a nga agohsoh amoh na amya ma a nati fene, ha ma a kwo; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />tasa amboh nza ma a bu na fene tasa mata a nga agohsoh amoh na amya ma a nati a mishi a kwo kpeh. Ni nga agohsoh na ata areh?<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Marta ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Haa, Ada meh nga kira la ni bu kristi, Amehreh Nnoh ata ta ka a nati ba inziyo reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A kpanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Marta nza ka a bleh dehreh, ka a na na afi ŋoh Maryamu na mgba nda. Ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana reh kǝ ba, tasa ka a luhu nnoh&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Maryamu nza ka a sehreh dehreh, ka a hinga a kate gbugbo ka a na na a hunji ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yeso kǝ hehreh ba bu niye ma akpo afiya reh kpeh, ŋoh neh ka a treh bu ma atsi Marta nza a na na a hunji ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Yahudawa mboh amboh ata nza ma a yama ma mgba afiya na Maryamu nza ma a ba ti tsifa na a ŋoh reh, nza ma a nza ŋoh atsi hinga na gbugbo a kate. Maka a bleh la a na ŋoh ikpi nyifo atsi kpanga ma a huru.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Maryamu nza ka a ba atsi Yeso nza a bu, nza ka anyi a nza ŋoh, ka a hwa ma tohmoh a ŋoh ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, tama a bleh la ni yama ma mareh, Asra amya ma a sohroh a kwo kpeh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yeso nza ka a nza ŋoh atsi kpanga reh, ka a nza kyangwri Yahudawa mboh nza ma a bu na a ŋoh atsi kpanga za reh; andromboh reh ka a wa ŋoh aniye nimeh agohsoh ŋoh, ta ka a nza kwini gaga. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Yeso a ka a luhu mboh la,&lt;&lt;Ni nyifo nnoh ma?&gt;&gt; maka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Ada, ba bu nza.<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yeso A kpanga. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Yahudawa mboh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza nnoh biroh kira ata nza a tsana ŋoh gaga reh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Mgbiri tswa amoh neh la,&lt;&lt;A wina vuru iyo ma kyangwri mboh amboh hama iyo, ha a bu dehreh kpeh? Mboh a ha ŋoh ta wina shwa Lazarus a gya na fene kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A yiri Lazarus Anyi Ma Kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Andromboh reh nza a ka a gyuru a wa Yeso aniye a keh, A ka a na ma ikpi nyifo, ata nza ma a lisa na kpakpa ma a gu a hama aniye ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Gu kpakpa reh hinga nnoh!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Marta, asra kyangwri ata nza a kwo reh ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ada, a nati ayingwo abibi, kǝ te ibi anneh nehnehreh nza ma anyifo ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Bu mya meh jiji bleh noh la nza ni nga agohsoh anzoh ni nati nza agba Nnoh kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Maka a gu kpakpa reh ata a hinga Yeso ka a nza inza a ka ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh kwende Nnoh Ada, la ni sere meh. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Meh wina la, ni kǝ sehreh meh na tutu, Meh bleh dehreh neh la kyangwri mboh a shi ma mareh, la mata nga agohsoh amoh la ni tohmoh meh,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Nza ka a bleh dehreh a treh, ka a vuru agba a fi mama a kate la, &lt;&lt;Lazarus, ka kate a ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Kyangwri ata nza ma anyifo ŋoh reh ka a kate a ba, hwana tasa ivoh a ŋoh mboh bu lafa ŋoh na kuri nyifo, tasa tohmoh a ŋoh a bu hamaa na hwashi kuri. Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Hingre nnoh ta a na a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A fa Akeki Mata A mla Yeso A kwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Ama 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mk 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Kyangwri Yahudawa mboh gaga nza ma a ba atsi tsifa na Maryamu reh maka a nza andromboh ata Yeso nza a lisa, Maka a nga kira amoh na a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Mgbiri amoh neh maka a gyuru a na na Farisiyawa mboh a na na a bleh mboh andromboh ata Yeso nza a lisa reh. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Tsifa wohroh Farisiyawa mboh tasa Agbugba Firist mboh maka a dohsohna mboh ma amboh chehcheh tsifa a nza reh, maka a luhu itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati lisa lele? Nza nnoh ndohmoh ŋara aniye ma kyangwri ata areh nza a leh a lisa reh! <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Nza meh ta ŋoh ta a leh a lisa ndohmoh ata areh reh, kyangwri mboh nambri ma a nati a nga ŋoh kira amoh, neh amboh kpra Romawa mboh ma a nati a druhu Ida Nnoh tasa inzi ambohroh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Kyangwri anyi nimeh amoh sa a ŋoh bu Kayafa, a bu Agba Firist ata inza ma ahushi wohroh, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ni duduna nnoh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ni kohnoh nza noh kpeh la a keh zohhoh kyangwri anyimbehreh ta a kwo tsifa kyangwri mboh, la inzi na agba ma ta a lofona.?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Tsifa ata kayafa nza a bleh reh, a bu kohnoh ata ikpi a ŋoh kpeh, la ŋoh bu Agba Firist ata inza ma ahushi wohroh, tana a bleh tsifa ma ikpi Yeso la, a nati a kwo ma kyangwri Yahudawa mboh, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />bu tsifa amboh de kpra Yahudawa mboh tsene kpeh, la neh ŋoh ta suhru kyangwri Nnoh mboh nambri amboh ata nza ma a sangrana a treh atsifi reh a ba akpo anyimbehreh.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Nyi ibi wohroh reh amboh de kpra Yahudawa mboh reh maka a leh a fa aki la mboh mata a mla Yeso reh a kwo. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Tsifa wohroh Yeso ka a za a gyuru a hehndeh ma hohroh Yahudawa mboh kakende kpeh, neh ka a yi atsi wohroh reh ata ta ka a na a ŋoh akpo anyi nda mgba babba, ma akpo afiya anyi maka a fi la, Ifrayim, ka a tuma ma a huru tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ameh kira gǝga handa ata Yahudawa mboh reh kǝ ba nda, kyangwri mboh gaga nyi akpokpo afiyafiya mboh maka a ka a na Urushalima la mata a na na a hehreh a hwara itoh amoh a gya na mgba tufa akeki amoh mboh feh ibi kira reh sa a ba. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Maka a leh a fa Yeso, maka a dohsohna ma ida Nnoh, maka a leh a luhu itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kohnoh nnoh lele? A nati a ba kira reh kpeh, a nati ba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />agba firist mboh tasa Farisiyawa mboh tama a nga aniye la, nza akyo a wina atsi ata Yeso nza a yama, ta a ba ba a bleh kanga, la mata a hunji a de ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ma Awo Ma Yeso Amehneh Ma Betani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Ama 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mk 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Kira gǝga handa ka a treh a hwa ibi atehrehkifi, Yeso ka a ba Betani, kpra Agohmoh ata Lazarus kyangwri ata Yeso ta ka a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo reh a bu na tuma ma a huru. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Maka a trisa ŋoh irya nvishi ma a huru, a bu Marta mi a gafa irya reh, Lazarus za a yama nimeh amboh ata nza ma a rya irya reh mboh ma Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Maryamu ka a gu amehneh wo nardi alindeh na su, amehneh wo angǝshi reh a bu wi ma, ka a gu ka a were a na ma hwana Yeso, a ka a gyuru a firu hwana a ŋoh mboh reh nashi na ikpi a ŋoh. Angǝshi amehneh reh ka a treh mgba afiya reh nambri.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Yahuda Iskariyoti neh, nza a bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh, ŋoh ta ka a nati a de ŋoh a nga mboh reh, ka a bleh la, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />&lt;&lt;A bu umbo a nati a ha mata a rifa amehneh wo angǝshi reh na hungroh agba mata a nga ma amboh iya mboh kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Yahuda a bleh tsifa ata areh a bu tsifa la ŋoh tana a kira mata a shingi kyangwri amboh iya mboh reh zizi kpeh, a bu tsifa la ŋoh reh tana a bu ayuhu, tasa za a bu ŋoh tana ka a de mboh jwa hungroh reh, tana ka a te ayuhu hungroh reh shidi nimeh a kpanga reh.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Yi nnoh ta tsehe,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Tana a sa amehneh reh a gya a bana ibi ata ma a nati anyifo meh reh mi. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />amboh iya mboh maka a yama na amohnoh na tutu, mohnoh neh ni kǝ bu noh na amya na tutu kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A fa Akeki la Mata A mla Lazarus A kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Vara kyangwri Yahudawa mboh nza maka a sehreh la Yeso a yama reh, maka a ba tsifa la mata a nza Yeso ma tsene, ma a ba za la mata a nza Lazarus ata Yeso nza a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo reh. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />agba firist mboh maka a tuma atsifa la mata a mla Lazarus a kwo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />la bu tsifa Lazarus ŋa Yahudawa mboh gaga ma za a kira na Firist mboh za kpeh, maka a leh nga agohsoh amoh ma Yeso.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Aniye A na Urushalima Tswanza Agohmoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Ama 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ibi nza ka a yanda vara kyangwri mboh gaga amboh ata nza ma a ba kira gǝga handa reh, maka a sehreh la Yeso a buti ba a ŋoh Urushalima. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Maka a fira avuvu ahweh anyi ma agbeh ahweh mboh ka a na na a hunji ŋoh, maka a leh a vuru agba a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">&lt;&lt;Hosanna!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Te atoh a bu na akyo ata nza a nati a ba nimeh isa Ada reh!&gt;&gt; te atoh ta a bu na Agohmoh Israila reh.<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yeso ka a hunji ameh nyama anyi ka a ka a tuma ma ikpi, tswanza tama ka a ŋa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh la,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />&lt;&lt;Kama nyiri nnoh kpeh, mohnoh kyangwri Sihiyona mboh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">nza noh Agohmoh amohnoh wa a ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">a tuma ma ikpi ameh nyama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Nza anyi na ameh wohroh reh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh ma a sohroh a wina andromboh kpeh. Ameh ata neh nza ma nga Yeso agba reh, maka a kohnoh la tama a ŋa ma ikpi a ŋoh, tasa awumu mboh reh ma bu yehlehleh tswanza tama ka a ŋa nimeh amgbasho reh.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Kyangwri amboh ata tama ka a yama na a ŋoh ameh ata ta ka a fi Lazarus la ta a kate anyi ma ikpi nyifo reh, a ka a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo, maka a leh a bleh kyangwri mboh andromboh ata Yeso nza a lisa reh. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Vara kyangwri mboh ma a na atsi sa Yeso reh, tsifa la ma a nza kpra ndohmoh ŋara aniye a ŋoh nza leh a lisa reh. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Farisiyawa mboh reh maka atsifa ma itoh amoh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza nnoh, mbohroh meh nati wina lisa andromboh kpeh, nza noh kyangwri mboh ma inziyo reh nambri ma a leh a tufa ŋoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bleh Kyangwri Mboh Tsifa Kwo A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh amboh anyi tama a yama ma Urushalima nimeh amboh ata ta maka a na atsi krumusu Nnoh ma atsi kira gǝga handa reh. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Maka a ba na Filibus, ŋoh nza bu kyangwri Betsaida nza a bu ma akpo afiya Galili reh, maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri agba, mbohroh meh kira meh ti nza Yeso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filibus ka a na na a bleh ma Andarawus; Andarawus mboh ma Filibus reh maka a na na a bleh ma Yeso.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la,&lt;&lt;Ameh kǝ ba ata ma a nati nga agba ma amehreh kyangwri. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Meh bleh noh zizi, nza ma anyifo yohroh biroh ma avru ta a kwo fya kpeh, a nati a bu yohroh anyimbehreh ma. Nza a kwo reh neh sa a mara yohroh gaga. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Akyo ata nza a kira na fene a ŋoh ma inziyo areh, a nati a hunji kpeh. Akyo ata neh nza a leke fene a ŋoh ma inziyo areh tsifa amya, a nati a hunji a zizi fene ata tuma atono. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Akyo ata nza a kira ta bu ahwra amya reh, a nati a tufa meh, tasa za atsi ata mya nza ni nati yama reh, ahwra amya reh a nati a bu ma a huru reh. Ada amya a nati a nga agba ma akyo ata nza bu ahwra amya reh.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Atsifa Ma Ikpi Kwo A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />&lt;&lt;Nehnehreh agohsoh amya a kputuna veve kpeh, meh nati kǝ bleh la umbo? Ha meh ti bleh la, &lt;Ada, sa meh hwana nyi na ameh ata meh nati wa iya meh ti kwo reh? Wa, mya meh ti kǝ ba reh tana a bu tsifa ameh ata areh mi. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Ada amya, nga agba ma isa anzoh!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Agba anyi ka anyi ma inza ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh nga ŋoh agba, meh nati gyuru nga ŋoh agba reh mishi za.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Duma mboh nza ma a yama ma a huru reh ma a sehreh agba tsifa reh, mboh neh ma a sohroh a sehreh tsifa reh a wina kpeh, maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu gohroh kpalala,&gt;&gt; Mgbiri ma a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu agba Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh atsifa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yeso a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Agba ata ti kǝ sere nnoh atsi leh tsifa reh tana a bu agba Nnoh, agba reh neh tana a ba tsifa amohnoh mi, tana a bu tsifa amya kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Ameh kǝ ba nehnehreh ata Nnoh a nati hwra akpi ma kyangwri mboh ma inziyo areh nambri, tasa za a bu nehnehreh ma a nati a fufa agugu ata nza a leh a de Agohmoh inziyo reh a kate. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Nza kyangwri mboh ma a gu meh anyi ma inzi a ka ma inza reh, meh nati wa kyangwri mboh reh ba ma itoh amya nambri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Yeso a bleh tsifa ata areh la ta a tsana biroh kwo ata nza a nati a ba ŋoh reh.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Duma mboh reh maka kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Amgbasho tsana reh a tsana reh la Kristi reh a nati tuma atono, a bu lele feh ni bleh la, &lt;Kyangwri ma a nati a gu amehreh kyangwri a ka ma inza kanga?&gt; A bu anyi nza a bu amehreh kyangwri reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Zana reh a nati a bu na amohnoh shidi ma. Mohnoh leh hende noh neh zana reh a treh a yama na amohnoh fya, la shini ta a sohroh a hunji noh kpeh. Kyangwri ata nza a leh a hehndeh nimeh shini reh a sohroh a wina aki na a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />nga nnoh agohsoh na zana reh neh a treh a bu na amohnoh, la mohnoh ti bu noh mara zanana mboh.&gt;&gt; Nza ka atsifa dehreh a treh, Yeso ka a na na a huho ikpi a ŋoh na amoh.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahudawa Mboh Ma A sa Tsifa Yeso A leke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Yeso feh kǝ lisa awumu ŋara aniye ma tohmoh kyangwri mboh, ma a sohroh a sa tsifa a ŋoh a kira kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Ata areh a bu dehreh la tsifa Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh reh ta a su:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Ada, a bu anyi a sa tohmoh ambohroh reh a kira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">tasa za ma a tsana ma anyi wuwana Ada ambohroh reh?<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />A bu tsifa wohroh ma a kira za kpeh, tsifa la Ishaya tana a bleh ma akpo anyi la:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />&lt;&lt;Nnoh kǝ hama mboh iyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">tasa za kǝ de agohsoh amoh mboh wuwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">la mata a nza na iyo amoh za kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">la ha mata a wina na agohsoh amoh mboh za kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nza mata a gyuruna a ba na amya reh, meh ti nga mboh wuwana.<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Ishaya tana a bleh dehreh tsifa la ŋoh tana a nza biroh agba ata ma a nati a nga ma Yeso reh, a bu tsifa wohroh nza a bleh tsifa mboh ma ikpi a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Dehreh za, mgbiri nimeh agbugba Yahudawa mboh reh ma a nga agohsoh amoh na Yeso. Mboh neh ma a nyiri Farisiyawa mboh, ma a sohroh a bleh ma kyangwri mboh la mboh ma a nga agohsoh amoh ma Yeso kpeh. Ma a nyiri la Farisiyawa mboh reh ma a nati a katsi mboh anyi ma atsi dohsohna amoh reh, <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />mboh reh ma a kira riri anyi na kyangwri mboh a keh riri ata nza anyi na Nnoh reh.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsifa Yeso A nati Ahwra Akpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yeso ka a vuru agba yivoh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a sa tsifa amya a kira reh, a sohroh a sa tsifa amya tsimya a kira kpeh, neh a bu na akyo ata nza a tohmoh meh reh mi. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Akyo ata nza a leh a nza meh reh, a leh a nza akyo ata nza a tohmoh meh reh za. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Mya meh ba inziyo reh tswanza zanana, la amboh ata nza ma a sa tsifa amya a kira reh, mata a tuma nimeh shini kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a sehreh tsana amya reh, ŋoh neh ta a sohroh a tufa mboh kpeh, a bu mya meh nati hwra ŋoh akpi kpeh. Meh sohroh ba tsifa la meh ti hwra akpi ma inziyo kpeh, meh ba tsifa la inziyo reh ta a hunji nvara. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Akyo ata nza a leke meh, tasa za ta a sa tsifa amya a kira kpeh reh, a bu na akyo ata nza a nati ahwra ŋoh akpi reh, tsifa ata mya nza ni bleh reh, a bu wohroh a nati a hwra ŋoh akpi ibi ata inziyo nza a nati a trina reh. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ata areh a bu zizi, tsifa la meh sohroh tsifa na wuwana amya kpeh, a bu Ada neh ata nza a tohmoh meh reh a bleh meh andromboh ata mya nza nati bleh noh reh. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Mya meh wina la tsifa ata areh a nati a nga noh fene ata tuma atono. Andromboh ata mya nza ni bleh reh, a bu andromboh ata Ada nza a bleh meh la meh ti bleh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A hwara Hwana amboh Tufa A ŋoh Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Tana a treh a hwa ibi anyimbehreh feh kira gǝga handa reh sa a tswa, Yeso ka a wina la ameh a ŋoh kǝ tswa ata ŋoh nza a nati ata inziyo areh ta a gyuru a na a ŋoh na Ada. Yeso tana ka a kira na kyangwri a ŋoh mboh nza ma a bu ma inziyo reh, tana ka a tsana mboh kira a ŋoh a gu a na ma trinaa.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Na ameh ata Yeso tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh ta maka a leh a rya irya nvishi, agugu kǝ jiji niye ma agohsoh Yahuda, amehreh Siman Iskariyoti, na kohnoh la mata a de Yeso a rifa, <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yeso a wina la Ada kǝ nga ŋoh wuwana ma ikpi awumu mboh reh nambri, a wina za la ŋoh tana anyi na Nnoh, tasa za ŋoh a nati a gyuru a na ŋoh na Nnoh. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />A ka a de a hinga anyi ma atsi rya irya reh, ka a de kuri ata inziyo ŋoh reh a fufa, tasa ka a lafa hwashi kuri ma chuhu yira. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ka a were amwo a na nimeh gbugba feh sa ka a leh a hwara hwana ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh, ka a leh a firu mboh hwana amoh mboh na hwashi kuri ata ŋoh nza a lafa ma chuhu yira a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Yeso ka a ba na Siman Abitrusu. Abitrusu ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, a bu noh mi ni nati hwara hwana amya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;nehnehreh ni sohroh wina andromboh ata mya nza ni lisa reh kpeh, a te shidi neh ni nati wina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Abitrusu ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Uwa&gt;&gt; Ni nati hwara meh hwana za kpeh ata tuma atono!&gt;&gt; Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Nza meh hwara Nnoh hwana kpeh reh, ni nati za bu amehreh tufa amya za kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />&lt;&lt;Siman Abitrusu ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, kama hwara meh ambasa hwana ma tsene kpeh! Hwara ivoh amya tasa ikpi amya za mishi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yeso a ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;amboh ata nza ma a ka a wra reh, itoh amoh ka a zanana ma a za a nati a hwara itoh nambri za kpeh, a nati ka a hwa ambasa hwana ma. Ni bu noh na zanana neh a sohroh a bu nambri ma amohnoh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yeso kǝ wina akyo ata nza a nati a de ŋoh a rifa reh, a bu ma ikpi tsifa wohroh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu nambri ma amohnoh ni bu noh na zanana kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Nza ka a treh hwara mboh ambasa hwana amoh reh, ka a gyuru a were kuri a ŋoh, tasa za ka a gyuru a na na a tuma ma atsi tuma a ŋoh, ta ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni nza andromboh ata mya nza ni lisa noh reh wina noh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />&lt;&lt;mohnoh ni leh fi meh noh la kyangwri tsana tasa Ada, a zohhoh nza ni fi meh noh dehreh reh, tsifa la a bu dehreh meh bu. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Mya nza ni bu Ada amohnoh tasa kyangwri tsana amohnoh reh, meh hwara ambasa hwana amohnoh, la mohnoh za ti hwara nnoh ambasa hwana itoh amohnoh kanga. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Mya meh lisa tsana noh, la mohnoh za ti lisa nnoh ika ata mya nza ni lisa tsana noh reh. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Meh bleh noh zizi, ahwra ka a wina keh Ada a ŋoh kpeh, tasa za amboh sa tohmoh nana ma a sohroh a keh akyo ata nza a tohmoh mboh reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />nehnehreh mohnoh nza ni wina noh awumu mboh reh, te atoh a nati a bu amohnoh nza ni lisa mboh nnoh reh!<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bleh Akyo Ata Nza A nati A de ŋoh A rifa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Ama 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mk 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />&lt;&lt;Meh sohroh leh tsifa ma ikpi amohnoh nambri kpeh; meh wina amboh ata mya nza ni seh mboh reh. Ata areh a bu dehreh la tsifa ata nza ma a ŋa nimeh amgbasho reh ta a su la, &lt;Kyangwri ata nza rya irya amya reh a bu ŋoh a fi meh ma tohmoh.&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Meh bleh noh areh nehnehreh feh sa bu dehreh, la na ameh ata tana a bu dehreh reh, ni nati sa tsifa reh kira nnoh la, &lt;Mya reh meh bu ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Meh bleh noh zizi, akyo nza a sa akyo ata mya nza ni tohmoh ŋoh reh, a sa meh mya za; tasa za akyo ata nza meh reh, a sa ŋoh ata nza a tohmoh meh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yeso nza a ka a bleh tsifa ata areh, tsifa reh a wa ŋoh aniye veve kpeh nimeh huru a ŋoh, a ka bleh tsifa ma ikpi amoh a kate la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh zizi, anyimbehreh nimeh amohnoh a nati a de meh a rifa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a nza itoh amoh a na, ma a sohroh a wina amehreh tufa ata Yeso nza a leh atsifa ma ikpi a ŋoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa mboh ata Yeso nza kira reh, a tuma ma nda Yeso <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Siman Abitrusu ka atsifa na a ŋoh na kpra ivoh la, &lt;&lt;Ta luhu Yeso ta a bleh mboh akyo ata ŋoh nza a leh atsifa ma ikpi a ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a kpusu ka a na na nda Yeso ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A ka bu ka anyi, Ada?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati soh mgbiri afohfohnoh reh ma gbugba. Ata nza meh nga ŋoh reh, a bu kyangwri wohroh.&gt;&gt; Yeso nza a gu mgbiri afohfohnoh a soh, ka nga Yahuda amehreh Siman Iskariyoti.<verse eid="JHN 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yahuda nza ka a sa afohfohnoh reh agugu ka aniye nimeh yira a ŋoh heri heri. Yeso ka a bleh ma Yahuda la,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:27">&lt;&lt;Andromboh ata nza ni nati lisa reh, lisa na gbugbo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Nimeh amboh ata nza ma a rya rya na a ŋoh reh, akyo anyi a sohroh a wina la ha Yeso reh a bleh ŋoh dehreh tsifa umbo kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Tana a bu Yahuda ŋa nza ka a de jwa hungroh amoh reh, mgbiri nimeh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh tama a gu la Yeso a bleh ŋoh la ta a na na a sa andromboh ata ma a nati a te ndohmoh na wohroh ma atsi kira reh, ha mata nga andromboh amboh nza iya mboh. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yahuda ka a sa afohfohnoh reh ta ka a kate ma hwana anyimbehreh. Na ameh wohroh reh shini kǝ ba.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Doka afeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yahuda nza a ka a na ŋoh reh, Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;nehnehreh ŋa ma a nati a nga agba ma amehreh kyangwri, tasa za ma a nati a nga agba ma Nnoh za ma aki a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Nza Nnoh ka a sa nga agba ma aki ŋoh, a bu Nnoh a nati a tsana nga agba amehreh kyangwri ma aki ikpi a ŋoh, a nati a lisa dehreh hwana anyimbehreh. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />mohnoh mara amya, meh nati za tre yama na amohnoh yanda kpeh. Ni nati fa meh noh, nehnehreh neh meh bleh noh andromboh ata meh ti kǝ bleh ma agbugba Yahudawa mboh reh la, &lt;Ni nati wina na nnoh atsi na amya reh kpeh.&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />&lt;&lt;nehnehreh meh nga nnoh akpi afeh ŋoh anyi: kira nnoh na itoh amohnoh. Tswanza mya nza ni kira nnoh reh, mohnoh za ti kira nnoh na itoh amohnoh kanga. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Nza ni bu noh na kira na itoh amohnoh reh, kyangwri mboh nambri ma a nati a wina la ni bu noh amboh tufa amya mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abitrusu A nati A tana la ŋoh wa wina Yeso kpeh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Ama 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Siman Abitrusu ka luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ada ni kǝ na ama?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ni nati wina tufa meh na atsi na amya nehnehreh kpeh, a te shidi neh ni nati wina tufa meh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Abitrusu ka a bleh ŋoh, &lt;&lt;Ada, a bu umbo a nati a ha meh meh ti tufa nnoh nehnehreh? Mya meh nati gu fene amya tsifa anzoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ni nati wina gu fene anzoh tsifa amya? Meh bleh noh zizi, ni nati tana meh te na atatoh bleh la ni wina meh kpeh feh agba sa a wri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Nana Ma Amehreh Tufa Yelele A ŋoh Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />&lt;&lt;Kama kira agohsoh amohnoh ta a kputuna kpeh. Sa tsifa Nnoh reh kira nnoh, tasa ti sa nnoh tsifa amya za kira nnoh. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Nimeh mgba afiya Ada amya atsi tuma gaga a yama; ma a ka a bu dehreh kpeh meh bleh noh ata areh kpeh. la meh nati na amya meh ti lisa nnoh atsi tuma. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Tasa meh ti gyuru na ni lisa noh atsi tuma, meh nati ba meh ti wa nnoh ba na amya, la mohnoh za ti tuma noh ma atsi ata meh yama reh. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Nnoh wina aki atsifi ata meh nati na reh&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Toma ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ada, mbohroh ma wina atsifi ata nza ni nati na reh kpeh, mbohroh meh nati lisa lele meh ti wina aki reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh, &lt;&lt;mya meh bu aki tasa ata a zizi tasa ata fene. akyo a nati a na na Ada kpeh ta a gǝga aki amya feh. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Nza ni wina meh noh ma a zizi reh, ni nati wina noh Ada amya ziza. Nza a gu anyi nehnehreh a na tohmoh, nnoh ni wina ŋoh tasa za ni nza ŋoh&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filibus ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh, tsana reh Ada tasa a nati tswa reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la; &lt;&lt;Meh yanda na amohnoh dehreh, a gu ka a ba nehnehreh ni wina meh noh kpeh, Filibus? Akyo ata nza a za meh, kǝ nza Ada. A bu lele feh ni bleh noh la, &lt;Tsana reh Ada&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Nnoh ni sohroh sa tsifa reh kira kpeh la meh bu nimeh Ada, Ada za a bu ni meh amya? Tsifa ata ma leh tsana noh a bu ni kira kpi amya kpeh ŋa, a bu Ada ŋa nza a tuma nimeh amya a leh a te ndohmoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Nga noh kira amohnoh na amya tsifa ata mya nza mi bleh noh la meh bu nimeh Ada tasa Ada za a bu nimeh amya. Ha nza bu dehreh kpeh reh, kira nnoh na amya tsifa agbugba awumu ata mya nza ni lisa reh. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Ma bleh noh ata a zizi, akyo ata nza a bu na nga agohsoh na amya a nati a te andromboh ata mya nza meh leh te reh, ma a nati a lisa agbugba awumu a keh ata areh, tsifa la meh kǝ na amya na Ada. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Mya meh nati lisa andromboh ata ni luhu nimeh isa amya, la Amehreh Nnoh ta a de agba a ba ma Ada. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Nza ni luhu meh andromboh nimeh isa amya, meh nati lisa.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bleh A gya Ba Huru Zanana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Nza ni kira nnoh na amya, ni nati tufa nnoh akpi ata mya nza ni nga nnoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Meh nati luhu Ada, ŋoh a nati nga nnoh akyo ata nza a nati a shingi nnoh reh ata tuma atono. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Huru ata a zizi, ata inziyo nza a wina hunji kpeh reh, la a sohroh a nza ŋoh kpeh tasa za a sohroh a wina ŋoh kpeh. mohnoh neh ni wina ŋoh tsifa la a tuma na amohnoh tasa za a nati a bu na amohnoh.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />&lt;&lt;Nza meh na amya reh, ma a nati a yi nnoh ta tswanza mara maku mboh kpeh, meh nati gyuru ba amya na amohnoh. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />A treh a hwa ameh shidi inziyo a nati a sohroh a nza meh kpeh. mohnoh neh ni nati nza meh noh tsifa la meh bu na fene, mohnoh nati hunji noh fene. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Ma Ibi wohroh nnoh nati wina la mya meh bu na Ada amya, tasa noh ni bu na amya,tasa mya ma bu na anzoh. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Akyo ata nza a sehreh lomo akpi a de ma agohsoh a ŋoh, a bu ŋoh ata nza a kira na amya. ata nza a kira na amya Ada amya nza a nati kira na a ŋoh, tasa mya nza meh nati kira na a ŋoh meh nati tsana ŋoh Ikpi amya&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />A bu Yahuda, a sohroh a bu Yahuda Iskariyoti kpeh, ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, a bu umbo? a te feh ni tsana ikpi anzoh kate na ambohroh, neh ta a sohroh a bu na mgbiri tswa ma inziyo kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yeso ka a kira a ŋoh,&lt;&lt;ha nza akyo ka a kira na amya, a nati a gya tsana amya ma agohsoh a ŋoh. Ada amya a nati a kira na a ŋoh, tasa ma nati ba na a ŋoh buti lisa afiya ambohroh na a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Ata nza a kira na amya kpeh a nati a gya tsana amya ma agohsoh a ŋoh kpeh. tsifa amboh areh nza ni sehreh a bu amya kpeh; ma a bu Ada ata nza a tohmoh meh.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Amboh areh nambri meh tini bleh meh ti kǝ bu na amohnoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Ata nza a nati a shingi reh neh, A bu Huru zanana, ata Ada nza a nati a tohmoh nimeh isa amya, a nati tsana noh awumu mboh nambri tasa ta a kohnoh nnoh awumu mboh nambri ata meh ti kǝ bleh noh reh. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Tuma alindeh ta a bu na amohnoh, a bu tuma alindeh amya mi meh nga nnoh, meh sohroh nga nnoh tswanza inziyo nza nga noh reh kpeh. Kama kputu nnoh agohsoh amohnoh mboh kpeh, tasa za ti kama nyiri nnoh kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />&lt;&lt;Nnoh sehreh meh la, mya ma kǝ na mya amya tasa meh ba mya na anzoh. nza ni kira na amya, ni nati bu na zana agohsoh la mya meh nati na mya na Ada, la Ada reh a keh agba na amya. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Meh tini bleh noh neh kǝ hehreh bu dehreh kpeh, la tana a bu dehreh reh ti sa tsifa reh kira nnoh. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Meh nati tsifa na anzoh yanda za kpeh, tsifa la kyangwri ata nza a de Agohmoh inziyo reh wa a ba. A bu na wuwana ma ikpi amya kpeh, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />inziyo neh a nati a wina la meh kira na Ada tasa meh te andromboh ata Ada mya nza a bleh meh reh yehlehleh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">&lt;&lt;Ba turoh timi hinga ta atsi ata areh.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Chuhu Agbeh Tasa Avohvoh Agbeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Mya meh bu mara agbeh inabi ata a zizi ŋoh, Ada amya ŋoh ŋa a bu kyangwri hafa mara agbeh inabi reh. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />A biri avohvoh amboh ata ma a mara ma itoh amya reh. avohvoh ata nza a mara a lisa a mishi la ta a mara gaga. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />nehnehreh ni bu noh na zanana ma ikpi tsifa ata mya nza ni bleh noh reh. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Bu nnoh nimeh amya, tasa mya za meh nati bu na amohnoh. Avohvoh agbeh inabi a nati wina mara na ikpi a ŋoh kpeh, a nati a wina mara ata nza anyi ma agbeh inabi reh. Ma aki wohroh za ni nati wina mara kpeh nza ni bu na bu na amya feh.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Mya meh bu agbeh inabi noh ni bu avohvoh agbeh reh. Nza kyangwri a bu na amya tasa mya meh ti bu na a ŋoh reh, a nati a mara mara agbeh gaga; ta a bu na amya kpeh nnoh nati wina lisa andromboh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Nza akyo ata a bu na amya kpeh, ŋoh a tswa nza avohvoh ata ma a shebiri ta a leh a hwara; maka a gu avohvoh Ikata wohroh, ma ata ava shira ta afiya a te tushira <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Nza na bu na amya tasa tsifa amya a bu na anzoh, luhu andromboh ata agohsoh a nza kira, ma a nati nga nnoh. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ti bu noh na agohsoh alindeh, ata nza a nati a tsana la ni bu noh amboh tufa amya mboh, tswanza agbeh ata ka a mara amehreh alilehndeh reh, a bu wohroh nza ka a de agba a ba ma Ada amya reh.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Meh kira na amohnoh tswa nza Ada nza a kira na amya reh, bu nnoh nimeh kira amya. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Nza ni tufa noh akpi amya mboh reh, ni nati bu na kira na amya, a tswanza mya nza ni tufa akpi Ada amya reh, meh kǝh tuma nimeh kira a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Mya tini bleh noh dehreh la nana agohsoh amya reh ta a bu na amohnoh tasa za nana agohsoh amohnoh za ta a ka a su. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />tsifa akpi a bu ata areh: kira nnoh ni Itoh amohnoh tswanza nzimi kira na amohnoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Kira agba anyi a yama ata nza a keh ata areh kpeh, nza a gu fene a ŋoh mata a mla ŋoh a kwo tsifa ziza a ŋoh mboh. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Ni bu noh ziza amya mboh nza ni te nnoh andromboh ata mya nza ni bleh noh reh. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Meh nati fi noh la ahwra za kpeh, la ahwra a sohroh a wina ndohmoh agba a ŋoh kpeh. wohroh meh ti fi noh la ziza amya mboh, tsifa la meh tini bleh noh andromboh ata mya nza ni sehreh nyi na Ada amya reh. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Mohnoh ni sohroh seh meh kpeh, Mya neh meh seh nnoh. Meh seh nnoh la ti na ni mara nnoh amehreh gaga. Biroh amehreh ika ata ma a nati a yanda. Ada reh a nati nga nnoh andromboh ata ni luhu nnoh nimeh isa amya. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Areh bu tsifa ata mya nza ni bleh reh la, kira nnoh ni itoh amohnoh.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inziyo A fi Amboh Tufa A ŋoh Mboh Ma Tomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Nza inziyo reh a fi noh ma tomo, wina noh la tana a jiji a fi meh ma tohmoh na amohnoh. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Bu ma a bleh la ni bu noh ata Inziyo, bu inziyo reh ma a kira na amohnoh tswanza awumu a ŋoh. Mya neh meh seh nnoh nyi ma inziyo, mohnoh ni sohroh bu noh ata inziyo kpeh, a bu tsifa wohroh inziyo nza a fi noh ma tomo reh. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Kohnoh nnoh tsifa ata mya nza ni bleh noh reh: &lt;Ahwra anyi ka a keh agba a ŋoh kpeh,&gt; Nza kyangwri ma nga meh iya, ma a nati nga nnoh iya za, ha mata a sa tsana amya reh a kira, ma a nati a kira na amohnoh za. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Ma a nati nga nnoh iya ma aki ata areh nimeh isa amya, tsifa la ma a sohroh a wina akyo ata nza a tohmoh meh reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Bu tama a bleh la meh ba meh ti bleh mboh kpeh, bu tama a bu na kpakpana kpeh. nehnehreh, ma a sohroh a bu na andromboh ata nza ma a nati a bleh ma ikpi kpakpana amoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Akyo ata nza a leke meh reh, a leke Ada amya za. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Meh tini lisa agbugba awumu meh ti kǝ bu na amoh reh, akyo kǝ hehreh wina lisa ika wohroh kpeh. Bu ma a bleh la meh lisa awumu mboh reh, bu ma a bu na kpakpana kpeh. nehnehreh neh mboh ma a nza andromboh ata mya nza ni lisa reh, ma a leke meh tasa mata a leke Ada amya za. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Areh neh ta a su andromboh ata ma a ŋa ma akpi amoh reh &lt;&lt;Ma a leke meh were ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Akyo ata nza a nati a shingi nnoh reh a nati a ba, a bu Huru Nnoh ata a zizi nza anyi na Ada reh, a nati a bleh tsifa ma ikpi amya. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Tasa mohnoh za ni bu noh amboh bleh tsifa ma ikpi amya, tsifa la ni bu noh na amya anyi ma jiji ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />&lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh amboh areh nambri la ti kama ta nnoh nga agohsoh amohnoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Ma a nati a katsi nnoh a kate ma ida Nnoh mboh; meh bleh noh shimba, ameh a nati a ba akyo ata nza a mla nnoh a kwo a nati a bleh a ŋoh la ŋoh a te ndohmoh ma Nnoh. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Ma a nati a lisa sehreh la mboh ma a sohroh a wina Ada ha mya kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Meh bleh noh tsifa amboh areh la ameh amoh tana a ba, ti kohnoh nnoh la mya tini bleh noh. Meh tini hehreh bleh noh nyi jiji ŋoh kpeh la mya tini bu na amohnoh.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndohmoh Huru Zanana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />&lt;&lt;nehnehreh meh gyuru na amya na ŋoh ata nza a tohmoh meh reh, neh anyi amohnoh a sohroh luhu meh la &lt;Ni kǝ na ama kpeh?&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Meh bleh noh awumu amboh areh agohsoh amohnoh ka kputuna gaga. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Mya neh meh bleh noh tsifa ata a zizi: A bu tsifa amohnoh nza meh na amya reh. Nza meh gyuru na amya kpeh, akyo ata nza a nati a shingi nnoh reh a nati a ba kpeh, nza meh gyuru na amya neh, meh nati tohmoh ŋoh ta a ba na amohnoh. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Nza tana a ba reh, a nati a tsana ma kyangwri inziyo mboh la kohnoh amoh a bu yehlehleh kpeh ma ikpi kpakpana, tasa ma ikpi tufa yehlehleh tasa hwra akpi Nnoh: <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />ma a bleh abibi ma ikpi kpakpana, tsifa ata kyangwri mboh nza ma a sohroh nga a sohroh nga agohsoh amoh na amya kpeh reh; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />ma a bleh abibi ma ikpi tufa yehlehleh, la meh na amya na Ada, ni nati za nza meh noh za kpeh; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />tasa za kohnoh amoh a bu yehlehleh kpeh ma ikpi hwra akpi reh, tsifa la Nnoh kǝ hwra akpi ata a zizi ma Agohmoh ata inziyo areh.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />&lt;&lt;Meh bu na tsifa gaga meh ti bleh noh, nehnehreh neh a nati a keh nnoh gaga ni nati wina de noh ikpi a hro kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Neh nza ŋoh, huru zizi, tana a ba, a nati a tsana noh aki a zizi ma ikpi Nnoh, a nati a wa a tsana aki a zizi mboh reh nambri. A nati a sohroh atsifa na wuwana ikpi a ŋoh kpeh; neh a nati atsifa andromboh ata ŋoh nza a sehreh reh tsene, tasa a nati a bleh noh andromboh ata kǝ hehreh su kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />A nati a de nga agba a ba meh, la a gu andromboh ata nza a bu amya tasa ta tsana noh ti wina noh. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Awumu ata nza a bu Ada a ŋoh nambri a bu amya. A bu tsifa wohroh ŋa nza meh bleh la huru reh a nati a fira anyi nimeh ata nza a bu amya tasa ta tsana noh ti wina noh.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kputu Agohsoh amboh Tufa Mboh A nati A te Johjoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />&lt;&lt;Kǝ hwa shidi ma ni nati za nza meh noh kpeh, tasa neh a nati a yanda shidi ma ni nati gyuru nza meh noh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />amboh anyi nimeh amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka luhu itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Wohroh a bu umbo? nza a bleh reh la &lt;Kǝ hwa shidi ma ni nati za nza meh noh kpeh reh, tasa la a nati a yanda shidi ma ni nati nza meh noh reh,&gt;tasa&lt;La meh na amya na Ada reh&gt;?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Maka a leh luhu la, &lt;&lt;Wohroh a bu umbo? nza a bleh la, &lt;a nati a yanda shidi ma reh&gt;? Meh sohroh wina andromboh ata nza a bleh reh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yeso a nza la ma a nati luhu ŋoh ata areh, ka bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni leh luhu nnoh itoh amohnoh ha a bu umbo? mya nza ni bleh reh la, &lt;A nati a yanda shidi ma ni nati za nza meh noh kpeh reh, tasa neh a nati a yanda shidi ma ni nati nza meh noh reh&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Meh bleh noh zizi, ni nati kpanga nnoh tasa ti kpanga rinana nnoh, inziyo neh a nati a johjoh. Ni nati hunji noh hungwa agohsoh, neh hungwa agohsoh amohnoh reh a nati a gyuruna a te johjoh. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Afya ata nza a nati mara a ka kpanga rinana la ameh rina a ŋoh kǝ ba; neh nza amehreh a ŋoh reh kǝ kate ka a gu rina reh a te kwo ahroh tsifa johjoh la ŋoh kǝ mara amehreh ma inziyo. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />A bu dehreh za na amohnoh: nehnehreh a bu ameh hungwa agohsoh, neh meh nati gyuru nza noh za, tasa za agohsoh amohnoh a nati a bu na nana agohsoh, biroh nana agohsoh ika ata wohroh reh akyo anyi a nati a sa a hwana anyi na amohnoh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Ma ibi wohroh ni nati za luhu meh noh andromboh za kpeh. Meh bleh noh zizi, Ada amya a nati nga nnoh andromboh ata nza ni luhu nnoh nimeh isa amya. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />A gu a ba ba a te nehnehreh mohnoh ni kǝ sohroh luhu nnoh andromboh nimeh isa amya kpeh. Luhu nnoh ma a nati nga nnoh, tasa johjoh amohnoh a nati a bu gaga.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rya tomo Ma Inziyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />&lt;&lt;Mya neh meh leh tsifa nimeh lomo tsifa, ameh a nati a ba ata mya meh za nati tsifa na amohnoh nimeh lomo tsifa za kpeh neh meh nati bleh noh kate ma ikpi Ada amya. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Ma ibi wohroh ni nati luhu nnoh nimeh isa amya. Meh sohroh bleh la meh nati luhu Ada aniye amohnoh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Uwa, Ada reh na ikpi a ŋoh a kira na amohnoh la mohnoh ni kira nnoh na amya tasa za la meh nyi na Nnoh.<verse eid="JHN 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Meh nyi na Ada ba bu niye ma inziyo; nehnehreh meh nati ta inziyo tasa za meh gyuru na amya na Ada.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Neh amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nehnehreh feh ni tsifa kate, tasa ni sohroh tsifa nimeh lomo tsifa za kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Nehnehreh mbohroh meh wina la ni wina awumu mboh reh nambri, tasa la ni kǝ wina sa aniye tsifa mboh reh feh akyo sa luhu nnoh andromboh. A bu tsifa wohroh mbohroh meh sa tsifa reh kira la ni nyi na Nnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yeso ka bleh mboh la? &lt;&lt;nehnehreh ni nga nnoh agohsoh amohnoh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />&lt;&lt;Ameh a nati a ba, tasa kǝ ba, ni nati gbo ta meh noh, anyi ma a nati a na a ŋoh afiya a ŋoh. Ni nati ta meh noh mya tsimya. Dehreh meh sohroh bu tsimya kpeh, Ada amya reh a yama na amya.<verse eid="JHN 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />&lt;&lt;Mya meh bleh noh awumu amboh areh, la nimeh amya ni nati hunji noh tuma alindeh. Nimeh inziyo areh ni nati te nnoh iya. Neh de agohsoh wuwa nnoh! mya meh keh wuwana inziyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yeso A kwere Nnoh Ma amboh Tufa A ŋoh Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yeso nza ka a bleh dehreh a treh, ka a gu iyo a ŋoh a ka inza ka kwere Nnoh la: &lt;&lt;Ada, ameh kǝ ba. Nga amehreh anzoh agba, la amehreh anzoh ta nga noh agba. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Nnoh ni nga ŋoh wuwana ma ikpi kyangwri mboh nambri la ŋoh ta a bu na fene ata tuma atono ma amboh ata nza ni nga ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Nehnehreh areh a bu fene ata tuma atono: la mata a wina noh la nnoh tsinzo ni bu Nnoh ata a zizi, tasa mata a wina Yeso Kristi, ata nza ni tohmoh ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Meh nga nnoh agba ma inziyo ma aki tre ndohmoh ata nza ni nga meh. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Nehnehreh, Ada, nga meh agba ma tohmoh anzoh na nga agba ata mya nza ni bu na wohroh feh masa a lisa inziyo reh.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A kwere Nnoh Ma amboh Tufa ŋoh Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />&lt;&lt;Mya meh tsana noh isa anzoh ma amboh ata nza ni nga meh nimeh inziyo areh. Ma a tana a bu anzoh; ni fira mboh nga meh tasa maka a tufa tsifa anzoh. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />nehnehreh ma a wina la awumu mboh nambri nza ni nga meh reh anyi na anzoh. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Meh nga mboh tsifa ata nza ni nga meh tasa maka a sa. Ma a wina zizi la meh nyi na anzoh, tasa ma a sa a kira la ni tohmoh meh. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Meh kwere Nnoh tsifa amoh. Meh sohroh kwere Nnoh ma inziyo kpeh, neh ma amboh ata nza ni nga meh reh, mboh reh ma a bu anzoh. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Andromboh ata nza mya nza ni bu na wohroh a bu anzoh, tasa andromboh ata nza a ba anzoh a bu amya. Meh hunji agba nyi na amoh. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Meh nati za bu ma inziyo za kpeh, mboh neh ma a treh a yama ma inziyo, meh ba na anzoh. Ada ata zanana, shwa mboh na wuwana isa anzoh, isa ata nza ni nga meh la mata a bu anyimbehreh tswanza mbohroh ma anzoh nza meh bu anyimbehreh reh. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Ameh ata meh ti kǝ bu na amoh reh, meh tini gya mboh alindeh na wuwana isa anzoh, isa ata nnoh nza ni nga reh. Meh shwa mboh, akyo amoh anyi a sohroh a bleh kpeh, a bu anyimbehreh wohroh ma ŋoh nza bu amehreh lofona reh, la tsifa ma amgbasho reh ta a su. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />&lt;&lt;Meh ba na anzoh nehnehreh, neh meh bleh tsifa amboh areh meh nza ni treh bu ma inziyo reh, la amboh tufa meh mata a hunji johjoh amya nimeh amoh nambri. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Mya meh nga mboh tsifa anzoh tasa inziyo ka leke mboh, la mboh ma a za a bu ata inziyo a keh meh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Meh sohroh kwere nnoh la ti fira mboh kate ma inziyo kpeh neh la ti shwa mboh nyi na agugu reh. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Ma a sohroh a bu ata inziyo a ŋoh kpeh tswanza mya nza ni sohroh bu ata inziyo areh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Lisa mboh ma aki ata nza bu zizi ata anzoh; tsifa anzoh a bu zizi. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Meh tohmoh mboh nimeh inziyo, tswanza noh nza ni tohmoh meh reh. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Meh lisa ikpi amya nga noh tsifa amoh, la mboh za mata a lisa ikpi amoh nga nnoh zizi.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A kwere Ma Amboh Nga Agohsoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />&lt;&lt;Meh sohroh kwere mboh tsimoh kpeh, meh kwere za ma amboh ata nza ma sa tsifa amya a kira ma ikpi tsifa amoh reh. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Meh kwere la nambri ma amoh mata a bu anyimbehreh. Ada, mata a bu nimeh ambohroh tswanza noh nza ni bu nimeh amya tasa mya nimeh anzoh reh. Mata bu anyimbehreh, la inziyo ta sa tsifa reh kira la bu noh ni tohmoh meh. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Mya meh nga mboh agba ata nza ni nga meh, la mata a bu anyimbehreh tswanza mbohroh anzoh reh za. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Mya nimeh amoh tasa nnoh nimeh amya. Ta ma a dohsoh ikpi amoh nambri la inziyo ta a wina la ni tohmoh meh tasa la meh kira na amoh tswanza noh nza ni kira na amya reh.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />&lt;&lt;Ada, meh kira amboh nza ni nga meh mata a bu ma atsi ata mya nza ni bu tasa mata a nza agba amya, agba ata nza ni nga meh la ni kira na amya feh masa a lisa inziyo reh <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Ada ata nza a bu yehlehleh, inziyo a sohroh a wina noh kpeh, meh wina noh, tasa za ma a wina la ni tohmoh meh. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Mya meh tsana mboh isa anzoh, tasa meh nati rya tohmoh na tsana mboh aki anzoh la kira ata nza ni kira meh reh ta a bu na amoh za tasa la mya za meh ti bu nimeh amoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ma A de Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Ama 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yeso nza ka kwere Nnoh a treh, ka a te a hwana fini Kidron mboh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh. Na ba fini reh, aye anyi a yama Yeso mboh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh maka aniye a na nimeh. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yahuda, ata nza a te ŋoh nyi reh, a wina atsi ata nza a yama reh, la Yeso mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh maka a dohsohna mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh ma a huru. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Neh Yahuda ka a fi amboh de ita ata Roma mboh, tasa amboh sumu ida Nnoh tasa agbugba firist mboh tasa Farisiyawa mboh nza ma tohmoh mboh, maka a mloh shira a de ma kpohkpoh mboh tasa afitila mboh tasa awumu mlana mboh.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yeso, a wina andromboh ata nza ma a nati a lisa ŋoh reh nambri, ka a kate ka a na na luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni hende fa nnoh anyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Maka bleh ŋoh la &lt;&lt;A bu Yeso ata Nazaret,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yeso ka a bleh mboh la &lt;&lt;Mya bu ŋoh&gt;&gt; Yahuda ata nza a te ŋoh nyi reh za ka a yama na amoh ma a huru. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yeso nza ka a bleh mboh la &lt;&lt;meh bu ŋoh,&gt;&gt; Maka a kpina a na na nyina maka a hwa ma inzi.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Ka a gyuru a luhu mboh za la, &lt;&lt;A bu anyi ni kira nnoh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu Yeso ata Nazaret.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yeso ka bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bu ŋoh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Nza ni hende fa meh noh, ta nnoh kyangwri amboh areh mata a na amoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />A ka a bu dehreh la tsifa a ŋoh reh ta a su: Ta ka a bleh reh la &lt;&lt;anyimbehreh amoh a sohroh a bleh meh nimeh amboh ata nza ni nga meh reh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Siman Abitrusu neh, nza a bu na ambya gara, ka wrofo ta ka shimba ahwra agba firist reh ma ashotoh ata mgba ivoh rya a kpa. Isa ahwra reh a bu Malkus.<verse eid="JHN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yeso ka bleh ma Abitrusu a de a wuwa la, &lt;&lt;Soh ambya gara reh na nimeh behreh ŋoh! Meh nati sohroh wa nimeh hohndoh ata Ada nza a nga meh reh kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A wa Yeso A na Ma Tomwo Annas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Neh amboh de ita ata Romawa mboh reh tasa agba amoh tasa amboh sumu ida Nnoh Yahudawa mboh reh maka a de Yeso maka a lafa ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Maka a de ŋoh a jiji a ba na Hannana, nza a bu alehmeh agba Kayafa, nza a bu agba firist reh. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayafa ka bleh ma Yahudawa mboh la a nati a zohhoh kyangwri anyimbehreh ta a kwo ma mgbiri kyangwri mboh.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abitrusu A tana Yeso Ata Jiji Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Ama 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mk 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Siman Abitrusu tasa atohngoh a ŋoh anyi maka tufa Yeso. La kyangwri tufa Yeso wohroh reh agba firist reh tana a wina ŋoh, ka tufa Yeso a na nimeh nashi agba kyangwri te ndohmoh ma ida Nnoh ma atsi hwra akpi reh. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Abitrusu neh ka a shi a bana ma aniye ida ma inziyo. Kyangwri tufa Yeso anyi ata agba firist nza a wina wohroh reh a bu Ayohana ka a kate a ba ba a tsifa na anyifa nza a shi ma aki reh, ka a wa Abitrusu reh aniye a na nimeh nashi reh. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Ahwra anyifa nza a shi ma aki reh ka luhu Abitrusu la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa Yeso reh?&gt;&gt; Ka a sa ŋoh aniye la, &lt;&lt;Uwayo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Atsifi tana a te awo, ahwra mboh maka a cha shira. Maka a shi a goh shira reh la ta a hwene mboh itoh, Abitrusu za ka a shi na amoh la shira ta a hwene ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agba Firist A luhu Yeso Tsifa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Ama 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Agba firist reh ka luhu Yeso tsifa ma ikpi amboh tufa ŋoh mboh tasa tsana a ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh kǝ shi tsifa tsana kate ma inziyo tasa nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh, tasa nimeh ida Nnoh, atsifi amboh wohroh ma a bu atsi dohsohna ata Yahudawa mboh nza maka a dohsohna reh. Meh sohroh bleh tsifa andromboh anyi na ayuhu kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Ni luhu meh tsifa umbo? luhu kyangwri amboh nza ma a sehreh meh ma atsi ata mya nza ni shi tsana reh. Ma a wina tsifa ata mya ti kǝ tsana reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Yeso nza ka a bleh dehreh a treh, amboh sumu mboh reh anyi nza a yama ma a huru ka mla ŋoh ma tomo. Ta ka a bleh ŋoh la &lt;&lt;Kama tsifa na agba firist dehreh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza meh bleh tsifa andromboh abibi,&gt;&gt; ti bleh andromboh ata nza a bu abibi reh kyangwri mata sere. Nza meh bleh tsifa a zizi neh ni mla meh tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Hannana reh neh ka a tohmoh la ma a gu Yeso a na na Kayafa na lafa ma na rishi, ŋoh nza a bu agba Firist reh.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abitrusu A tana Yeso A te Na Afri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Ama 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mk 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Abitrusu nza ka a treh a tuma a lala itoh a ŋoh ma shira, kyangwri anyi ka a ba ba luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh za ni bu anyi nimeh amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh kpeh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Abitrusu ka a gyuru a tana za la, &lt;&lt;Uwayo, meh bu na amoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Anyimbehreh nimeh ahwra agba firist reh tana a yama, ŋoh ahwra reh a bu alohsoh kyangwri ata Abitrusu ta ka a shimba ashotoh a ŋoh na ambya gara reh, ka luhu Abitrusu la, &lt;&lt;Meh kama bleh amya kpeh la meh tini nza noh mohnoh ma a ŋoh nimeh aye reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Abitrusu ka a gyuru a tana za neh, agba ka a wri heri.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A de Yeso A na Na Bilatus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Ama 27:1-2</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Na nerebi shishini ma, Yahudawa mboh maka a wa Yeso anyi afiya Kayafa a na afiya Agohmoh ata gomnati Roma. La mboh mata kama a chakafana mata a fa kavoh na rya awumu rya kira gǝga handa reh kpeh, maka a sohroh aniye a na nimeh afiya reh kpeh, la mboh mata a hunji a rya irya gǝga handa reh. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Bilatus ka a ba ba luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ŋa nnoh kyangwri areh la a lisa nnoh umbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Maka bleh ŋoh la &lt;&lt;Ma a bleh la a lisa andromboh abibi kpeh, mbohroh meh sohroh de ŋoh ba na anzoh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Bilatus ka bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Wa nnoh na ti na ni hwra noh akpi na ikpi amohnoh nimeh akpi amohnoh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Yahudawa mboh reh maka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;mbohroh neh meh sohroh tswa meh ti hwra akpi ata mla akyo kwo kpeh,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Ka a bu dehreh tsifa ata Yeso ta ka a bleh ma ikpi kwo a ŋoh reh ta a su.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Bilatus ka aniye a na nimeh nashi Agohmoh, ka a fi Yeso ta ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yeso ka a sa ŋoh aniye la, &lt;&lt;Ni luhu meh tsifa ata areh, &lt;&lt;Ha a bu akyo a bleh noh ma ikpi amya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Bilatus ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni gu la mya reh meh bu kyangwri Yahuda?&gt;&gt; Ni lisa mboh feh kyangwri anzoh mboh tasa Agba Firist mboh masa a de noh a ba na amya?<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yeso ka bleh la, &lt;&lt;De Agohmoh amya a sohroh a bu ata inziyo areh kpeh. Ma a bleh la a bu ata inziyo areh, amboh tufa meh ma mlana a shwa meh la Yahudawa mboh mata kama a de meh kpeh. De Agohmoh amya a sohroh a bu ata inziyo areh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Bilatus ka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza a bu dehreh ni bu Agohmoh reh?&gt;&gt; Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh na ikpi anzoh ni bleh la meh bu Agohmoh. Tama a mara meh a ba ma inziyo areh tsifa anyimbehreh wohroh reh ŋa, la meh ti ba bu bleh tsifa a zizi. Akyo ata nza a bu ata a zizi reh ka sehreh tsifa amya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Bilatus ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu umbo a bu zizi reh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Ma A shimba Akpi Kwo Ma Yeso</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Ama 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mk 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Bilatus neh ka a gyuru a kate a na ŋoh na kyangwri Yahudawa mboh reh ma inziyo ka a na na a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh kama hunji ŋoh na andromboh ata meh nati shimba ŋoh akpi kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Neh ma tsifa ata amehmeh ata nza ni bu noh na wohroh mya nza ni kǝ tavoh kyangwri nyi ma ida ka anyimbehreh ba nnoh na ameh kira gǝga handa reh. Ni kira nnoh meh ti tavoh nnoh Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Maka a te kpiriga a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Uwayo, ŋoh kpeh! Mbohroh meh kira ti tavoh Barabba mi! (Barabba reh tana a bu ayuhu abibi)<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Neh Bilatus ka bleh ma amboh de ita a ŋoh mboh reh la mata a mla Yeso na awaradada. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Amboh de ita mboh reh maka tsyumu gbama ikpi na atohtoh maka a gu ka a gya ŋoh ma ikpi; Neh maka a were ŋoh kuri ata nza a sha njwenjwenjweh, <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />maka a ba ba a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Fene anzoh ta a yanda Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh!&gt;&gt;Maka a na na a riba ŋoh mla. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Bilatus ka a gyuru a kate za ka bleh ma duma mboh reh la,&lt;&lt;Nza nnoh, meh nati de ŋoh kate ba na amohnoh na mareh ti nza noh la meh kama hunji ŋoh na andromboh abibi ata shimba ŋoh akpi kwo kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Yeso ka a kate a ba na gbama ikpi ata atohtoh reh tasa ka a were kuri ata nza a sha njwenjwenjweh reh. Bilatus ka bleh mboh la, Nza nnoh! kyangwri reh uweh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Agba firist mboh tasa amboh sumu ida Nnoh nza maka a nza ŋoh, maka a te kpiriga a bleh la, de kpa nnoh ma gbohrohgboh! De kpa nnoh ma gbohrohgboh!&gt;&gt;Bilatus ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mohnoh ba bu de noh na ni kpa nnoh. Mya meh kama hunji ŋoh na andromboh abibi ata meh ti shimba ŋoh akpi kwo kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Yahudawa mboh reh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh bu na akpi ata nza a bleh la a tswa ŋoh atsi kwo kanga, la a bleh la ŋoh a bu amehreh Nnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Bilatus nza ka sehreh dehreh, ka lisa a nyiri a keh. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Ka aniye a na nimeh afiya Agohmoh reh ta ka luhu Yeso la, Ni kǝ nyi ama?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Bilatus ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Ni nati sohroh tsifa na amya kpeh? Kohnoh la meh bu na wuwana meh ti sa noh hwana tasa ata de noh kpa ma gbohrohgboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh bu na wuwana ma ikpi amya tsifa ata nza a bu Nnoh a nga noh. Dehreh kyangwri ata nza a de meh a nga noh reh a bu na kpakpana abibi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Bilatus nza ka a sehreh dehreh, ka a fa aki la ŋoh ta a yi Yeso reh ata avoh. Yahudawa mboh reh neh maka a gyuru a te kpiriga la, &lt;&lt;Nza ni ta ŋoh avoh, wohroh a tsana la ni sohroh bu iza Agohmoh agba kpeh! Akyo ata nza a bleh la ŋoh a bu Agohmoh reh a fi Kaisar ma tohmoh. <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Bilatus nza ka a sehreh tsifa duma mboh reh, ka a wa Yeso a kate ta ka tuma ma ikpi kpra hwra akpi a ŋoh ma akpo anyi maka a fi la &lt;&lt;Dada Kpakpa mboh.&gt;&gt; Na mgba Yahudawa mboh maka a fi la &lt;&lt;Gabbata&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Tana a bu na mgba atsitsi fi noh ata ibi kira gǝga handa reh. Bilatus ka a bleh ma Yahudawa mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Agohmoh amohnoh reh uweh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Yahudawa mboh reh maka a gyuru a te kpiriga la, &lt;&lt;Mla ŋoh kwo! mla ŋoh kwo! de ŋoh kpa ma gbohrohgboh!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Bilatus ka a gyuru a luhu mboh za la, &lt;&lt;Ni kira nnoh meh ti kpa Agohmoh amohnoh ma gbohrohgboh?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">agba firist mboh reh maka kira la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh sohroh bu na Agohmoh anyi kpeh, a bu Agohmoh Kaisar ma ŋoh tsene.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Neh Bilatus ka a de Yeso a nga mboh la mata a de ŋoh a kpa ma gbohrohgboh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">neh maka a sumu Yeso<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A de Yeso A kpa Ma Gbohrohgboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Ama 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Ka a kate, Yeso ka a gu gbohrohgboh a ŋoh, ka a na na &lt;&lt;Atsi akohkohroh ikpi,&gt;&gt;tswanza nza maka a fi reh na mgba Yahudawa mboh la &lt;&lt;Golgota.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Maka a de ŋoh a kpa ma a huru; maka a kpa kyangwri amboh anyi mboh afri, anyi na mgba ivoh rya a kpa anyi na mgba ivoh a mina Yeso ka a bu ma atsitsifi amoh. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Bilatus ka a ŋa tsifa anyi a gya ma gbohrohgboh reh la, Yeso ata nza anyi Nazaret, Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh, a bu wohroh ŋa nza ma a ŋa a gya reh. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Kyangwri mboh gaga maka a leh a bleh tsifa reh, la atsi ata mata ka a kpa Yeso reh tana a bu ma inda afya ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:20">Tsifa reh tama a ŋa a gya Na arimi Yahudawa, tasa arimi Romawa mboh tasa ata Helenawa mboh. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />agba firist mboh maka a bleh ma Bilatus la, &lt;&lt;Kama ŋa la Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh reh kpeh, ŋa la, &lt;Kyangwri areh a bleh la, Meh bu Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Bilatus ka bleh la, &lt;&lt;Andromboh ata mya nza ni ŋa reh ta tuma dehreh kanga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />amboh de ita mboh nza maka a de Yeso a kpa a treh, maka a gu kuri a ŋoh a gafa a te anneh, amboh de ita mboh reh maka a de anyianyi. Maka a gu kuri ata inziyo ŋoh ata nza ma tsyumu anyi inza a ba ba a te inzi a sohroh a bu na aki wono ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Amboh de ita mboh reh maka a bleh ma itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh ti kama hwashi kuri reh kpeh; ba turoh meh ti were akabeh meh ti nza ha a ka a bu anyi a nati a hunji.&gt;&gt;Ka a bu dehreh la amgbasho Nnoh reh ta a su la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">&lt;&lt;Ma a hwashi kuri amya gafa ma itoh amoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">maka a were akabeh na kuri amya reh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">amboh de ita mboh reh ma a lisa dehreh. <verse eid="JHN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />amboh nza ma a shi ma inda gbohrohgboh Yeso reh ma a bu akre, afi akre, Maryamu nza a bu afya Kilobas, tasa Maryamu ata nza anyi Magadala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yeso ka a nza akre mboh ma kyangwri tufa a ŋoh ata ŋoh nza kira reh ma shi ma a huru; neh ka bleh ma akre reh la, &lt;&lt;Afya areh a bu amehreh anzoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Neh ka bleh ma Amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Areh a bu atono amohnoh.&gt;&gt; Anyi na wohroh Amboh tufa a ŋoh reh ka a wa ŋoh a na na a tuma ma afya a ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwo Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Yeso a wina la awumu mboh reh nambri kǝ su; tasa la amgbasho Nnoh reh ta a su, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Yohroh amwo a keh meh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Amgbo anyi a yama ma a huru a bu na amwo inabi ata nza a teh jwa; maka a gu asohsoh anyi a te fohfohnoh a soh ma amwo inabi reh maka a hamba ma agbeh izob maka a gu a ka ma aniye Yeso <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yeso ka a wa amwo inabi ata nza a teh jwa reh ka bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kǝ trina!&gt;&gt; Neh ka a soh ikpi a ŋoh a tamba ta ka a gu itoh a ŋoh ata avoh.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A hamba Yeso Ma A sangra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Neh agbugba Yahudawa mboh maka a luhu Bilatus la ta ata mboh mata a kya hwana kyangwri amboh ata ma ta ka a de mboh a kpa reh, tasa mata a fira kohmoh amoh mboh reh a tamba anyi ma gbohrohgboh reh. Mboh reh ma a sohroh a kira la kohmoh kyangwri mboh reh ta a tuma ma gbohrohgboh reh a na na a te ibi asabar reh kpeh la tana a bu ibi juma mi. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Neh amboh de ita mboh reh maka a na na a kya hwana kyangwri ata anyimbehreh ŋoh tasa ata afri ŋoh ata ma ta ka a de mboh a kpa mboh ma Yeso reh, <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Nza maka a ba na Yeso neh, maka a nza la kǝ kwo, maka a sohroh a kya hwana a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />anyimbehreh nimeh amboh de ita mboh reh neh, ka a hamba Yeso na mbeh ma a sangra, imya tasa amwo ka a kate. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Ata nza a nza ata areh reh ka a bleh la, mohnoh za ti sa nnoh tsifa reh kira nnoh la, andromboh ata nza a bleh reh a bu zizi. La ŋoh a bleh zizi.) <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Ma a lisa dehreh la amgbasho Nnoh reh ta a su la: &lt;&lt;Akofo a ŋoh anyi a nati a sohroh a kyana kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Amgbasho anyi a bleh za la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ma a nati a nza ŋoh ata mboh nza ma a hamba ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma Anyifo Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Wohroh nza ka a gǝga, Yusufu ata nza anyi Akpo afya Arimatiya, ka a na na a luhu Bilatus la ŋoh ta a na na a gu kohmoh Yeso reh (Yusufu reh tana a bu kyangwri tufa Yeso na ayuhu, la ŋoh tana a nyiri agbugba Yahudawa mboh.) Bilatus ka a bleh ŋoh la ta a na na a gu kohmoh Yeso reh, Yusufu ka a na na a gu a de a na a ŋoh. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodimus ata ta ka a na na a nza Yeso nashi ni reh, ka a tufa Yusufu reh, a de awumu angǝshi ata nza ma a lisa na mur tofo na alo, ata nza arishi kilo agrumavoh adada atatoh. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Kyangwri mboh afri reh maka a gu itoh Yeso maka a lafa na kuri lilin tasa awumu angǝshi alindeh reh ika ata Yahudawa mboh nza maka a lisa kohmoh feh masa anyifo reh. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Aye anyi a yama ma atsi ata ma ta ka a kpa Yeso a kwo reh, ikpi nyifo afeh anyi tana a yama ma aye reh maa a hehreh anyifo akyo nimeh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Ibi asabar Yahudawa mboh reh tana a hwa ibi anyimbehreh ma, tasa za ikpi nyifo reh tana a yama ma inda a huru, maka anyifo Yeso reh ma a huru.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Ikpi Nyifo Reh A bu Wusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Na nerebi shishinima ibi Lahadi, Maryamu ata nza anyi Magadala ka a na ikpi nyifo reh ka a na na a nza maa a yi kpakpa ata ma ta ka a hama ikpi nyifo reh na wohroh <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Ka a gbo a na na Siman Abitrusu tasa kyangwri tufa Yeso ata Yeso nza a kira na a ŋoh reh, ka bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Maa a gu Ada reh a hinga ma ikpi nyifo Mbohroh za meh sohroh wina ha ma a gu ŋoh a na na a fi na ama kpeh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Neh Abitrusu mboh ma kyangwri tufa Yeso ata Yeso nza a kira na a ŋoh reh maka a na ikpi nyifo reh. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Na afri ma amoh maka a buti gbo, neh kyangwri tufa anyi reh ka a gbo a keh Abitrusu, ka a na na a jiji aniye ma ikpi nyifo reh. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Ka dohnoh a nere ka a nza kuri lilin reh, neh ka a sohroh aniye a na nimeh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Siman Abitrusu ta ka a treh nyina a ŋoh reh za ka a na na aniye ka a gǝga aniye a na nimeh ikpi nyifo reh. Ka a nza hwashi kuri lilin reh atsi leh ma a huru, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />tasa hwashi kuri ata ma ta ka a lafa ikpi Yeso na wohroh reh. Kuri reh a gugununa a tuma ma akpo anyi tse ata kuri lilin reh. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Ma trina ŋoh kyangwri tufa ata ta ka a jiji a gbo a na ikpi nyifo reh, za ka aniye a na nimeh ikpi nyifo reh ka a nza ta ka nga agohsoh a ŋoh.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Ma a sohroh a wina amgbasho Nnoh nza a bleh reh la, a nati a hinga anyi ma ikpi nyifo kanga feh reh kpeh.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Neh amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka a na amoh afya.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A kate Ma Maryamu Ata Nza A nza Anyi Magadala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Maryamu ka a shi a kpanga ma akachi ikpi nyifo reh. Nza ka a treh a shi a kpanga reh, ka a dohnoh ka a nere ikpi nyifo reh <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />ka a nza mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh afri ma a were kuri atatasaa, ma a tuma ma atsi ata ma ta ka a fi kohmoh Yeso reh, anyimbehreh na mgba ikpi anyi na mgba hwana. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Afya ni kǝ leh kpanga umbo?&gt;&gt;Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Maa a gu ada amya a na amoh, meh sohroh wina ha ma a gu ŋoh a na na a fi na ama kpeh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Neh a gyuruna ka a nza Yeso atsi shi ma a huru; ŋoh neh ka a sohroh a wina la a bu Yeso reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yeso ka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Afya ni kǝ leh kpanga umbo?&gt;&gt;&lt;&lt;Ni kǝ leh fa anyi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">A nza a ŋoh la a bu kyangwri te ndohmoh ma aye reh mi, ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ni gu ŋoh na akpo anyi reh, meh nga nnoh agba, bleh meh ni fi ŋoh na ama, meh ti na ni gu ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yeso ka a fi ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Maryamu!&gt;&gt;Ka a gyuruna a nza ŋoh ta ka a fi ŋoh na mgba Yahudawa mboh la, &lt;&lt;Rabboni!&gt;&gt; (Wohroh reh la &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana.&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kama de meh kpeh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;la mya meh hehreh gyuru na amya inza na Ada kpeh. Neh na na atsi amya mboh ti na ni bleh mboh la Mya meh nati gyuru na na a ŋoh ata nza a bu ada amya, Nnoh amya tasa Nnoh amoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Ka a bu dehreh Maryamu nza anyi Magadala ka a na na a bleh ma amboh tufa mboh reh la ŋoh kǝ nza Ada ka a bleh mboh za tsifa mboh ata ŋoh nza na a bleh ŋoh reh.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A kate Ma amboh Tufa A ŋoh Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Na Nvishi ibi lahadi wohroh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka dohsohna ma akpo anyimbehreh maka a ka anida mboh, la tama a nyiri agbugba Yahudawa mboh. Neh Yeso ka a ba ba a shi nimeh amoh. Ka bleh mboh la, Tuma alindeh ta a bu na amohnoh. <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />nza ka bleh mboh dehreh a treh, ka tsana mboh ivoh a ŋoh mboh tasa a sangra a ŋoh reh. amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh maka nza nana veve kpeh nza ma a nza Ada Yeso reh. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yeso ka a gyuru a bleh mboh za la, Tuma alindeh ta a bu na amohnoh. tswanza Ada nza a tohmoh meh reh, mya za meh tohmoh nnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Neh ka akpi fene ta ka afo inyo a were mboh ta ka a bleh mboh la &lt;&lt;Sa noh huru zanana. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Nza ni gu kpakpana kyangwri mboh te nnoh kohhroh, ma a nati a bu na kpakpana kpeh; nza ni sohroh gu kpakpana amoh te nnoh kohhroh kpeh, ma a nati a bu na kpakpana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso Mboh Ma Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />anyimbehreh nimeh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh, Toma nza ma a fi la sehfeh reh), tana a sohroh a yama na amoh na ameh ata Yeso ta ka a ba reh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh nza Ada reh!&gt;&gt;Toma reh ka a bleh la, nza mya meh nza hohndoh ata ma ta ka a kpa ŋoh na akusu ma ivoh a ŋoh reh meh ti soh ameh ivoh amya na nimeh hohndoh reh, feh meh si sa tsifa reh kira.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Sati anyimbehreh nza ka a gǝga, amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka a dohsohna za nimeh ida maka a ka anida mboh, tasa Toma za ka a yama na amoh. Akeki mboh maka a bu ka ŋoh, Neh Yeso ka a ba ba a shi nimeh amoh ka bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Tuma alindeh ta a bu na amohnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Neh Yeso ka a bleh ma Toma la, &lt;&lt;Soh ameh ivoh anzoh na ma mareh, ti nza ivoh amya reh; neh nga kira ti bara a sangra amya reh ti nza. Ti kama sa tsifa reh leke kpeh, ti sa tsifa reh kira!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toma ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada amya tasa Nnoh amya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Neh Yeso ka a bleh Toma la, &lt;&lt;Ni nga agohsoh tsifa ata nza ni nza meh reh? Johjoh agba a bu na amboh ata nza ma a sohroh a nza meh kpeh, neh ma a nga agohsoh amoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsifa Ata Nza Ma A bleh Amgbasho Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Ma tomo amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh, Yeso ka a lisa vara ndohmoh ŋara aniye amboh ata nza ma a sohroh a ŋa nimeh amgbasho ata areh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Neh ma a ŋa amboh areh la mohnoh ti sa kira nnoh la Yeso a bu Kristi, amehreh Nnoh, tasa la nimeh nga agohsoh amohnoh na ŋoh ti hunji noh fene nimeh isa ŋoh.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yeso A tsana Ikpi A ŋoh Ma Amboh Kpehkpehteh A ŋoh Atehrehkifi Na Anyi Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Yeso ka a gyuru a kate ma amboh tufa ŋoh za ma fini Tibariya. A ka a tsana ikpi ŋoh dehreh <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Siman Abitrusu, Toma (nza maka a fi la sehfeh reh), Nataniyel nza anyi Kaana ata Galili, tasa mara Zabadi mboh, tasa amboh tufa Yeso amboh anyi mboh afri za maka yama ma a huru. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Siman Abitrusu ka a bleh ma mgbiri mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Meh na amya atsi de kpo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Maka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;mbohroh za meh nati wa nnoh.&gt;&gt; Maka aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh a na amoh Na shini wohroh reh neh, maka a sohroh a de andromboh kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />nnoh nza ka a gu ikpi a ka, Yeso ka a shi ma aniye fini reh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh neh maka a sohroh a nza ŋoh a wina kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yeso ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mara kafa mboh, ni bu noh na kpo nnoh?&gt;&gt; Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Uwayo meh sohroh de andromboh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Ka bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Fi nnoh arishi de kpo amohnoh reh na nnoh ma amwo reh na mgba ivoh rya a kpa ata gbogblondo amwo reh, ni nati de noh kpo amboh anyi.&gt;&gt;Neh maka a were arishi maka a za a bu na wuwana ata kpi arishi de kpo amoh reh a kate kpeh, la ma a de kpo mboh reh gaga. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Kyangwri tufa ata Yeso nza a kira na ŋoh reh, ka a bleh ma Abitrusu la,&lt;&lt;A bu Ada!&gt;&gt; Abitrusu nza ka a sehreh la a bu Ada reh, ka a gu kuri a karafa ma itoh (ŋoh reh tana a fufa kuri ma itoh) ta ka a tsyumuna aniye a na nimeh amwo reh. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Mgbiri amboh tufa mboh maka a ba akachi fini nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh. Maka akpi arishi amoh mboh reh na kpukpo mboh na su nimeh. Tama a sohroh a bu gbugba na akachi fini reh kpeh, tana zaka a bu yadi agrumavoh dida agrumavoh ma. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Nza maka a kate a ba ma akachi fini ma inzi a tuhwara reh, maka a nza sehsehreh shira ma a huru, kpo atsibinaa a yama ma ikpi tasa afohfohnoh za. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, de kpo amboh anyi nimeh amboh ata nza ni de noh reh ba nnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Siman Abitrusu ka a ka a na nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh, ta ka akpi arishi de kpo mboh reh a ba ma akachi fini. Arishi de kpo mboh reh a bu na agbugba kpukpo mboh reh 153, kpo mboh reh tama a bu gaga dehreh neh, arishi reh ka a sohroh a hwashina kpeh. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yeso ka bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ba bu rya nnoh irya.&gt;&gt; Nimeh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh akyo a sohroh luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu anyi kpeh?&gt;&gt; la mboh tama a wina la a bu Ada. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Neh Yeso ka a na na a gu afohfohnoh reh, ka nga mboh; ka a lisa dehreh za na kpo reh. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ata areh a bu kate Yeso ata atatoh ata ŋoh ta ka a kate ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh na ameh ata ma ta ka a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo reh.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso Mboh Ma Abitrusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Nza maka a rya a treh, Yeso ka a bleh ma Abitrusu la, &lt;&lt;Siman Amehreh Ayohana, ni kira na amya keh amboh ata areh?&gt;&gt;Ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ha, ada,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ni wina la meh kira na anzoh.&gt;&gt; Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Lisa nza ameh atashi amya mboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yeso ka a gyuru luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Siman amehreh Ayohana, ni kira na amya?&gt;&gt; ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ha, ada, ni wina la meh kira na anzoh.&gt;&gt; Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Lisa nza meh atashi amya mboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Na atatoh Yeso ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Siman amehreh Ayohana, ni kira na amya?&gt;&gt; Abitrusu ka kputu agohsoh a ŋoh telema la Yeso luhu ŋoh a te na atatoh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kira na amya?&gt;&gt; ka a gyuru a bleh ŋoh za la, &lt;&lt;Ada, ni wina awumu mboh nambri; ni wina la meh kira na anzoh!&gt;&gt; Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Lisa nza meh atashi amya mboh. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Meh bleh noh zizi: nza ti kǝ tre bu kafa, ni kǝ were kuri anzoh na ikpi anzoh ti na atsi ata nza ni kira; nza ni te achoh neh, ni nati nyifa ivoh anzoh akyo anyi ta a were nnoh kuri ta a wa nnoh a na atsi ata nza ni sohroh kira te na kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />(Nza bleh dehreh reh, Yeso a tsana aki ata Abitrusu a nati a kwo ta a de nga agba a ba ma Nnoh.) Neh Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Tufa meh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso Mboh Ma Kyangwri Kpehkpehteh A ŋoh Anyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Abitrusu ka a gyuruna ka nza kyangwri tufa ata Yeso nza kira na a ŋoh reh ma nyina a ŋoh, ata ta ka a leh ma nda Yeso ma atsi rya irya ta luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ada a bu anyi a nati a te nnoh agugu reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Abitrusu nza ka a nza kyangwri tufa ata Yeso nza a kira reh, ka luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ada ŋoh kyangwri ata areh neh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yeso ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza meh kira la, ta a tuma na fene mya tini gyuru ba feh, anzoh umbo? Tufa meh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Neh amboh tufa Yeso mboh maka a hehndeh ahwra a bleh ma itoh amoh la, kyangwri tufa Yeso wohroh a nati a kwo kpeh. Yeso neh a sohroh a bleh la kyangwri wohroh a nati a kwo kpeh; a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza meh kira la, ta a tuma na fene mya tini ba feh reh, anzoh umbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ŋoh a bu kyangwri tufa Yeso ata ta ka atsifa ma ikpi awumu amboh areh, a bu ŋoh za a ŋa mboh a gya; mbohroh meh wina la andromboh ata nza a bleh reh a bu zizi.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Awumu amboh anyi ma a yama gaga ata Yeso nza a lisa. Ma a bleh la mata a ŋa a gya nambri ma akpo anyinyimbehreh, nza amya, inziyo nambri a nati a sohroh a wina de amgbasho amboh ata nza ma a ŋa reh kpeh.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>